<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Etulo</book>
  <para style="h">iJɔn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esɔ Osuse mi abɔ mgbi iJɔn</para>
  <para style="toc2">iJɔn</para>
  <para style="toc3">iJɔn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Esɔ Osuse mi abɔ mgbi</para>
  <para style="mt1">iJɔn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Elodzɛ yɛɛ inggisɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Mi owita-wita mgbi ɛsɛ ma Elodzɛ dzɛ, Elodzɛ na dzɛ yi Imgbasho, Elodzɛ na di li Imgbasho. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>O dzɛ yi Imgbasho mi owita-wita mani.<verse eid="JHN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Alungwɔ ngwi Imgbasho ta duu nyɛ mbon, ni li Ongwu bayɔ ungwɔ ngwi Imgbasho ta duu o ki ta ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Li mbon ngwi oshishe dzɛ, ma oshishe na li osa mgbi inggisɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Osa na di gbosa mi iifu kpaa iifu difwin gbɛ ba.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Imgbasho kye inggisɛ oka dɛsɔ ba, iyin di iJɔn. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>O ba ikye owa nu obwɛndɛ mgbi osa na, adzi ni inggisɛ duu noyɛyɛ mi osa nani. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Li ongwu abuon li osa ma ba, o ba ikye owa kyɔ osa na obwɛndɛ ta. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Osa otsitsi nka nu ali inggisɛ odifwi-difwi ma ka kyɛma le ba ɛsɛ nɛni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naadi nɛnɛ li osa otsitsi nka nu odifwi-difwi mbi ali inggisɛ ngwu ba ɛsɛ nɛni. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>O teyi dzɛ ɛsɛ nɛni, dafi Imgbasho ta ɛsɛ nɛ mbon nɛ kpaa, emi ɛsɛ difwin ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>O ba mbi ama nli mgban kpaa a gbela gban ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Nghaduukpaa ama ngban mani, mbi ama nnoyɛyɛ mi iyi mgban ma, o nu ma ofɛ oyɛɛ emi ongwɛ Imgbasho, <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>engwɛ ngwu a mba ma mi mmbwɛ yi eyi ba, hona mi ɛwɛ otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi inggisɛ owamyɛ naadi mi owitukwu mgbi obongyaa ba, kpaa nli ombaamba mgbi Imgbasho mi onodzi mani.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Ta Elodzɛ na yɛɛ inggisɛ wa dzɛ yi eyi. Eyi di okwɔkwɔ mgban, okwɔkwɔ mgbi Ongwɛ Imgbasho Onyi kpokpo, ntɔkyɛ mbi Otsɛ Imgbasho, ngwu elela mgban mbwo le fɛ-fɛ bɛyi otsitsi nani.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>IJɔn kyɔ obwɛndɛ ikyon. O di gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ongwu ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongwu nkyɛ ani iyikpa ma o ngha ani, ikyekyɛ o teyi ani dzɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Elela mgban nle dzii ikye eyi nɛ, nu eyi duu gbumse idzidza-dzidza. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Bana a kye ola nu mi abɔ mgbi iMose; elela bɛyi otsitsi ba mi abɔ mgbi iYesu iKrestu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongwu Imgbasho zondu gbɛɛ o ka ba wa dulu ɛsɛ watɔ ma.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Inggisɛ onyi di Imgbasho ye ba, sede li Ongwɛ onyi kpokpo ndi li Imgbasho mi otsitsi di wodzɛ ifafɔ yi Otsɔn nani, li ongwu tso eyi dafi Imgbasho dzɛ aali.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IJɔn okyɔ iBatisima tangwɛ gbɛɛ <optbreak/> ongwu li iKrestu ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Onɔ oka nɛ, engyukwo emi iJuda ama nto iJerosalin dɔ ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi emi iLevi esɔ nu ma ka byi iJɔn ita gbɛɛ, o li emɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>O kye da ma ba, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li iKrestu ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>A byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nghama abu li emɛ? Abu li Elaijaa?&gt;&gt; O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei li ani ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">&lt;&lt;Abu li oyegbɔ maa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Mi ongyɛɛngyɛ nɛ a si byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li emɛ? Nu eyi elodzɛ ngwi eyi ka yilen ka nya ama ndɔ eyi esɔ ntonani. Abu gbɔsinɛ mi ikye ewabu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>IJɔn nu ma uka mi elodzɛ mgbi oyegbɔ Adzaya gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li ela mgbi ongwu nle kwu mi okwɛsɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;Mɛlu ofɛ mgbi Otsɛ no byi yɛyɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Ama ngwu a dɔ ma esɔ ma li emi iFarasi. <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>A byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni abu li iKrestu, naadi Elaija, hona oyegbɔ kpaa ba ma, i kyɔsinɛ ngwi abu le kyɔ inggisɛ iBatisima?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>IJɔn nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani le kyɔ inggisɛ iBatisima yi eni, kpaa inggisɛ oka kwudzɛ idzidzɛ mgbi ema, ongwu ema yon ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>O kyɛ ani iyikpa, odi okpafɔ mgban kpaa ani mɛ oshɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Ungwɔ ntonɛ duu kiyayi mi iBetani, mi oyombo ekyoo iJodan, imbe ngwi iJɔn le kyɔ inggisɛ iBatisima mani.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dii ongwummala mgbi Imgbasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Tegblifan iJɔn di iYesu kyɛ le ba mbon nɛta o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii ongwummala mgbi Imgbasho, ongwu nkyi kyelu alobube mgbi ɛsɛ mani! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Li ongwu ani nya ema odzɛ mgban gbɛɛ, &lt;Inggisɛ oka kyɛma ngwu ngha ani, ikyekyɛ o teyi ani dzɛ.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Ani abuani kpaa nose yon ba, kpaa itɔdzɛ ngwi ani ba le kyɔ inggisɛ iBatisima yi eni ma, li ikye okyon tso mbi emi Israi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Ta iJɔn si nu ma obwɛndɛ nɛni: &lt;&lt;Ani di Onodzi Osaan tashulu mi esho dafi anyama mani wa tila dɔnkɛ ewo. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Ani kika yon ba, nghaduu Imgbasho ndɔ ani esɔ owa kyɔ inggisɛ iBatisima yi eni ma nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyulɔ ngwu abu di Onodzi mgbi ani tila dɔnkɛ ewo ma, li ongwu ka kyɔ inggisɛ iBatisima yi Onodzi Osaan aali.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Ani di kyɔ obwɛndɛ gbɛɛ nɛnɛ li Ongwɛ Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Engwafɔ mgbi iYesu emi ababɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Tegblifan nɛ iJɔn diyɛ kwudzɛ yi engwafɔɔn nghi efa. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Ngwi o dili iYesu nyɛ le lu nɛta o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii, li Ongwɛ Mmala mgbi Imgbasho ma aani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Ngwi engwafɔ mgban ntonɛ fwo odzɛ ngwi o gbɔ nɛta, a kyɛdɔ iYesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Ngwi iYesu kyata di ma kyan iyikpa nɛ, o byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ekyɛ ngwi ema mina?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, li mi ole ngwi abu dzɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba ta ema ka di.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Man a kɛ ka di imbe ngwi o dzɛ mani, diyɛ dzɛyan mi egbe na olɔlɔ duu. Onɔ li obyi enɛ ongwi onɔdɛ sini.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andru, ongwunɔ iSaimɔn iPyita, li onyi mi idzidzɛ inggisɛ efa ama nfwo odzɛ ngwi iJɔn gbɔ di kyɛdɔ iYesu mani. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Ungwɔ ababɔ ngwi Andru kyɔ yɔ, o pita iSaimɔn ongwunɔn nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi tu Onagbɛ ngwu Imgbasho zondu ma wa&gt;&gt; (ongwu nli iKrestu nani). <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Nɛ o si kyon luba mbi iYesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">IYesu din inɛ si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li iSaimɔn ongwɛ iJɔn. A ka kwu abu di iKefa&gt;&gt; (ngwi a li kwun di iPyita, ngwi itan li ikwutsɛ nani).<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kwu iFyilipi bɛyi iNataniɛ ela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Tegblifan iYesu wewo le lu iGalalia. O wa tu iFyilipi si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɛdɔ ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>IFyilipi li inggisɛ mi iBɛtsaida imbe onyi yi Andru bɛyi iPyita. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>IFyilipi tu iNataniɛ si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi tu ongwu iMose lɔ odzɛ mgban mi afɛ mgbi ola, ongwu ama ogbɛɛsɛ kpaa lɔ odzɛ mgban nani, iYesu ongwi iNadzareti, ongwɛ iJose.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Ta iNataniɛ byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔ osuse ka yagba tɔ mi iNadzaretii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">IFyilipi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba wa di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Ngwi iYesu di iNataniɛ kyɛ le to kwɛkwɛ nɛ, o gbɔdzɛ mi ikpewon gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li inggisɛ Israi otsitsi, ongwu atsika onyi dzɛ mbon ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>INataniɛ byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kyɔsinɛse ye ani?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani di abu ngwi abu ka dzɛ ita andundu duuse ni iFyilipi wa kwu abu ela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Man iNataniɛ byakpa ghatɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, abu li Ongwɛ Imgbasho; abu li Utɔ mgbi Israi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu noyɛyɛ ikyekyɛ ani nya abu gbɛɛ ani di abu mi ita andundu. O ka wa di ungwɔ ama nshewo ngha ntona kpaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>O diyɛ kiyayi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, ema ka di esho ka kwulu lakɛ asisa, engyesɔ mgbi Imgbasho kale kɛ esho yɛ ba esɛ mbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kyata eni yɛɛ eneekwɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Mi egbe ongwu ta ma eba okwokyiikwokyi dzɛ ogalu iKana mi ɛsɛ iGalalia. Onɔ iYesu dzɛ ele, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>nɛ iYesu yi engwafɔ mgban kpaa a bɔ ma eba okwokyiikwokyi nani. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Ngwi eneekwɔ wa ngyɛ nɛ, onɔ iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A sulu eneekwɔ wuba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛn, li ekyɛ ngwi abu kye ani le wokɛ ele? Onɔ mgbi ani gyɔ waba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Onɔn si nya engbidɔ ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔ alungwɔ ngwi o nya ema duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Atankpɛ akwutsɛ mgbi eni nghi egyin to kwɛkwɛ mi imbe nani, itɔ ngwi emi iJuda li sa ewoma mi odzɛɛdzɛ aletɔ mgbi ama mani, ali atankpɛ li kye ikpɔkpɔ eni mɛ osu lu osudiwyo.<verse eid="JHN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>IYesu nya engbidɔ ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kweni mbwo atankpɛ ntonɛ na.&gt;&gt; A si kweni mbwo ma kyɛɛ kyɛɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Ta o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ yɔ, mwa ka nu ongyukwo mgbi oga nɛ tsatso na.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:8">A si kyɔ dafi o gbɔ mani, <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>man ongyukwo mgbi oga nɛ mbadi eni ngwi o kyatan yɛɛ eneekwɔ nani. O ye imbe ngwi eneekwɔ nɛ tɔkyɛ ba, kpaa engbidɔ ama nkweni ma ye. O kwu obongyaa ofufɛ ela lu enggengga, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>ka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ali inggisɛ li teyi kye eneekwɔ osuse tasɛ se wa kye obube ba olɛlɛ onɔ ngwi ingyoga wa ungwɔ kpakpa mani, nghaduu abu kye osuse da nghataa ba onɛnɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Nɛnɛ li ambɛ okwulewo ongwi ababɔ ngwi iYesu kyɔ mi iKana mi iGalalia. O kye okwɔkwɔ mgban tso, nɛta engwafɔ mgban si kye oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ama byikɛ mbon.<figure style="fig" alt="iYesu kyata eni yɛɛ eneekwɔ" file="DN00453b.tif" size="col" loc="2;11" copy="Dunhan" ref="2:11">Jesus turns water into wine</figure><verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbosa ozu okwukwo osunu <optbreak/> Imgbasho mi iJerosalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Ungwɔnɛ wa ngyɛ man o lu iKapenahun yi onɔn yi emi ongwunɔn bɛyi engwafɔ mgban. A la imbe na egbe efa.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ngwi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda na wa dzɛ kwɛkwɛ nɛ, iYesu lu iJerosalin. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>O ka to ifoozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin nani, o di inggisɛ tole kye mnda, mmala yi anyama le gya, angbeka sɔto ewo adinyatsɛ tole nyinɛ awuya. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Ta o shi onitse mi osha, si lɔ ma onya duu tasɛ mi ifoozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho, bɛyi emi mmala yi mnda tsatsa; o kye ganya awuya mi adinyatsɛ mgbi ama onyinɛ awuya di kyi kyata adinyatsɛ ma tukwu esɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Ama nkye anyama le gya ma o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbelu ungwɔ ntonɛ tasɛ mmɛnɛ na! Kyɔnɛ ngwi ema kyata ozu mgbi Otsani yɛɛ idu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Engwafɔ wɛ dafi a lɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Okpitukwu mgbi ani mi ikye ozu mgbi abu le gbɛ mi itukwu mgbi ani dafi ola mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Emi iJuda byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ali ambɛ okwulewo ngwi abu ka yagba tso eyi zukwu ni eyi difwi mfye ngwi abu sulun se kyɔ itɔ ungwɔ ntonɛnɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbobu ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho nɛni, ta ani ka yilen mbɛ mi egbe eta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Emi iJuda byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I kye onova ngwusefa dɔn egyin ombɛ ozu nɛni, nghanɛ abu ka yilen mbɛ mi egbe eta taa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Nghaduu ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho ngwi o le gbɔdzan na li ewo mgban. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Mi onɔ ngwi a wa kyilon mi ikwongye ma se engwafɔɔn wa ka wɛ odzɛ ngwi o teyi gbɔ nani. Man a si noyɛyɛ mi afɛ bɛyi elodzɛ ngwi iYesu teyi gbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Dafi o ka dzɛ iJerosalin mi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi nɛ, inggisɛ kwuba di ambɛ okwulewo ama ngwi o le kyɔ nɛta, a noyɛyɛ mi iyi mgban. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Nghaduu iYesu gbela kye ewon nu ma ba, bana o ye ngyɛ ali inggisɛ duu. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>O mina obwɛndɛ mgbi inggisɛ ikye inggisɛ ba, ikyekyɛ o teyi ye ungwɔ nwodzɛ mbi inggisɛ mani.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">INikodemu kɛ mbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Inggisɛ iFarasi oka nose dzɛ iyin di iNikodemu, o li onyi mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama o gbe emi iJuda teyi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>O ba mbi iYesu mi otu wa nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, eyi ye abu li otsetse nkyɛ mbi Imgbasho. Bana inggisɛ onyi ka yagba kyɔ ambɛ okwulewo ama ngwi abu le kyɔ nɛ ba ni Imgbasho dzɛyan bayɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N le nya abu otsitsi, inggisɛ onyi ka yagba di esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho gbɛ ba se ni a yilen mba akpe efa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>INikodemu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A ka kyɔsinɛse yile inggisɛ mba ngwi o yɛɛ omyinɛ nɛ? O ka yagba yɛ kaka ifu mbi onɔn akpe ongwu fan ni a yilon mba gbɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N le nya abu otsitsi, inggisɛ onyi ka kaka esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ba se a ka mban mi eni bɛyi Onodzi. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Mmbwɛ yi eyi li mba mmbwɛ yi eyi, Onodzi li mba onodzi. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>No ka kwulu abu ewo mi odzɛ ngwi ani gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Se a ka yile abu mba na ba.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Awo li fa lu imbe ngwi i mina. Abu ka fwo owulu-wulu mgban kpaa abu ka ye imbe ngwi i tɔkyɛ hona imbe ngwi i le kɛ ba. Li ngha ndzɛ yi ali inggisɛ ngwu a mban mi Onodzi aali.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nɛ iNikodemu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kyɔsinɛse ungwɔnɛ ka dzɛ ngha gbɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngwi abu li otsetse mgbi emi Israi nɛ kpaa, abu yagba difwi ungwɔ ntonɛ lo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>N le nya abu otsitsi, eyi ye ungwɔ ngwi eyi le gbɔ, eyi dile nu obwɛndɛ mi ungwɔ ngwi eyi di, nghaduu ema gbela yi obwɛndɛ mgbi eyi ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Ani gbɔdzɛ yi abu mi ungwɔ ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ kpaa abu noyɛyɛ ba; ma ka kyɔsinɛse ngwi abu ka noyɛyɛ kini Ani gbɔdzɛ yi abu mi ungwɔ ongwi esho? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Inggisɛ onyi kpaa kɛ esho ye ba se li Ongwɛ Inggisɛ nkyɛ esho nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Dafi iMose nose byi ifa kyilen esho mi okwɛsɛ na li ngha a ka wa kyile Ongwɛ Inggisɛ esho kyɛmɛ aali, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>adzi inggisɛ ngwu noyɛyɛ mbon yɔ no ka dzili ba, kpaa no tu oshishe gyegwu.<verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>&lt;&lt;Lubana Imgbasho di ɛsɛ nɛ kpan itukwu jo o kye Ongwan onyi kpokpo nu, gbɛɛ ali inggisɛ nnun oyɛyɛ ta no ka dzili ba, kpaa no tu oshishe igyegwu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Bana Imgbasho dɔ Ongwan esɔ ba ɛsɛ ikye owa fwo ɛsɛ ikwɔ nun obube ba, kpaa li ikye ni ɛsɛ watɔ ikpewon. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Ali inggisɛ nnun oyɛyɛ yɔ o ka dzili ba, kpaa ali inggisɛ nnun oyɛyɛ bayɔ teyi dzili wa ikyekyɛ o noyɛyɛ mi iyi mgbi Ongwɛ Imgbasho onyi kpokpo na ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Nɛnɛ li ikwɔ ma aani: Osa ba ɛsɛ nɛni, kpaa inggisɛ nghao mina iifu ngha osa ikyekyɛ okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi ama li ibwubwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Ali inggisɛ nkyungwɔ ibwubwe yɔ, o di osa lanyi nghanɛ o ka gbela ba imbe ngwi osa dzɛ ba di ali ibwubwe mgban wa dɔ ododa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ nkye otsitsi teyi yɔ, o ka ba imbe ngwi osa dzɛ zukwu nu ma difwi saan gbɛɛ ungwɔ ngwi ongwu kyɔ nɛ kyɛ mbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndɛ mgbi iJɔn ikye iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛta iYesu yi engwafɔɔn tasɛ lu ikpɛsɛ iJudia, ka kye egbe gwee yi ama le kyɔ ma iBatisima. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Onɔ na iJɔn kpaa le kyɔ iBatisima mi Ayenɔ kwɛkwɛ yi iSalin, ikyekyɛ eni kwoba ba, inggisɛ dile ba tonya ba gbɛɛ ni iJɔn kyɔ ma iBatisima. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>(Ungwɔnɛ li onɔ ngwi a kye iJɔn wo obawi waba mani.) <verse eid="JHN 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Angwodzɛ tɔ mi idzidzɛ mgbi engwafɔ iJɔn angbeka bɛyi inggisɛ iJuda oka mi odzɛ ewo ofwɔɔfwɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>A ba mbi iJɔn wa gbɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, inggisɛ ndzɛ yi abu nose mi oyombo iJodan ongwu abu kyɔ obwɛndɛ saan mi ikyon na, o le kyɔ iBatisima, ma ali inggisɛ duu le lu mbon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>IJɔn nu uka mi odzɛ nɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ka yagba kyungwɔ ba sede ni Imgbasho ongwi esho kye nun yɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Ema abuema ka kyɔ obwɛndɛ gbɛɛ ani teyi nya ema gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani li iKrestu ma ba a dɔɔdɔ ani esɔ teyun ta.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Ongyaa ofufɛ li mgbi obongyaa ofufɛ. Uka mgbi obongyaa li fwoofwo yi obongyaa, o di li mbwo yi atsa onɔ ngwi o fwo ela mgbi obongyaa mani. Atsa na li mgbi ani, di li ngha ngwi atsa mgbi ani li mbwumbwo aali. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>IYesu ka sheeshe lu iyayi, ani ka yɛɛyɛ esɛ.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>&lt;&lt;Ongwu nkyɛ esho ba ma ngha duu, ongwu ntɔkyɛ ɛsɛ ma li mgbi ɛsɛ, o li gbɔdzɛ dafi inggisɛ nkyɛ ɛsɛ. Ongwu nkyɛ esho ma ngha duu. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>O kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ungwɔ ama ngwi o fwo diyɛ di, kpaa inggisɛ onyi gbela yi obwɛndɛ mgban ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Inggisɛ ngbela yan gbela gbɛɛ Imgbasho li otsitsi. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Lubana ongwu Imgbasho dɔn esɔ ma gbɔ elodzɛ mgbi Imgbasho, Imgbasho nun mfye mgbi Onodzi odondu ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>O kpa Otsɔn itukwu o di kye alungwɔ duu dɔn ubɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Ali inggisɛ ngwu nu Ongwɛ oyɛyɛ yɔ dzɛ yi oshishe ogyegwu, ali inggisɛ nfwa Ongwɛ yɔ ka di oshishe ba, lubana itingga mgbi Imgbasho ka dzɛyan gyegwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔdzɛ yi ongyaa iSamaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Emi iFarasi fwo gbɛɛ iYesu nghao le tu ama okyɛdɔn dile kyɔ ma iBatisima ngha iJɔn, <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>yama li iYesu abɔn le kyɔ iBatisima ba, kpaa li engwafɔɔn le kyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>IYesu wa ye nghanɛ man, o dzata ayɛsɛ mgbi iJudia yidɔ lu iGalalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>I wogyɔ ngwi o ka nyɛ ongwi iSamaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Nɛ o wa to igeli mgbi iSamaria oka ngwi a li kwun di iSika, kwɛkwɛ yi ongwɛ imbe ngwi iJeko kye nu iJose ongwan nani. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Ibuga mgbi iJeko dzɛ imbe nani, dafi indɛ mgbi agaba kwu iYesu nɛ, o sisɛ mi ewo ibuga ngwi onɔ dɔ idzidzɛ udɛ sini.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Onɔ ngwi ongyaa iSamaria ba owa kweni nɛ, iYesu byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O ka nu ani eni owawa wɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>(Engwafɔ mgban lu ifu igeli oka gya ungwogye.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Ongyaa iSamaria na nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li inggisɛ iJuda, ani li ongyaa iBatlomi. Kyɔsinɛse ngwi abu le bɔ ani eni owawa?&gt;&gt; (Bana emi iJuda li kwokyi yi emi iBatlomi ba.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni abu ki ye umba mgbi Imgbasho ndzɛ mi ikye mgbi abu bɛyi inggisɛ nle bɔ abu eni owawa nɛ yɔ, abu kika bɔ ta, o kika nu abu eni mgbi oshishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, abu dzɛ yi odi okweni ba, ibu nɛ kɛ ma abu ka tu eni mgbi oshishe nɛ mi ole? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Abu shewo ngha otseyi iJeko nkye ibuga nɛ nu eyi di weni mi ele abuon, ngwi ɛngbɛ mgban kpaa wa bɛyi ifyungwɔ mgban naa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ali inggisɛ nweni nɛ yɔ ekweni ka yɛ kwun, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>kpaa ali inggisɛ nweni ngwi Ani kye nun yɔ ekweni ka kwun wuba. Mi otsitsi, eni ngwi Ani kye nun na ka yaan uteeni di kale fɛ nghataa kaka oshishe gyegwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ongyaa na nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, nu ani eni nani adzi ni ekweni ka kwin wuba, nin di nya yi eni owa kwɔɔkwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kwu obabu ela no ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani dzɛ yi ongyulɔ ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O gbɔ ayin dafi abu gbɛɛ abu dzɛ yi ongyulɔ ba nani. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Otsitsi, abu teyi sulu engyulɔ nghi eda, ongwu abu dzɛyan onɛnɛ nɛ kpaa li obabu ba. Odzɛ ngwi abu kwa gbɔ nɛ li otsitsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, dzɛ ani dafi abu li oyegbɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Emi otseyi teyi li sunu Imgbasho mi unggwɔ nɛni, nghaduu ema emi iJuda yɔ li gbɛɛ li mi iJerosalin kyɛmɛ ngwi eyi ka sunu Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>IYesu ghatɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa, nu ani oyɛyɛ, onɔ kyɛma ngwi ema ka wa sunu Otsɛ Imgbasho mi unggwɔ nɛ hona mi iJerosalin kpaa wuba. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Ema emi iBatlomi le sunu ungwɔ ngwi ema yon ba; eyi emi iJuda yɔ, eyi le sunu ungwɔ ngwi eyi yon, bana owatɔ-watɔ kyɛ mbi emi iJuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Lubana onɔ kyɛma di li onɔ ma aani, ngwi ali inggisɛ osunu mi otsitsi ka sunu Otsɔn Imgbasho mi onodzi bɛyi otsitsi kyɛmɛ, lubana li itɔ ama osunu ngwu Otsɔ Imgbasho le pita ma aali. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Imgbasho li Onodzi, ama osunun nu ma sunun mi onodzi bɛyi otsitsi kyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ye Onagbɛ (ongwu a kwun di iKrestu ma) kyɛma. Onɔ ngwi o wa ba yɔ, o ka nu eyi osa mi alungwɔ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Man iYesu ghatɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani ma jo le gbɔdzɛ yi abu aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Engwafɔ iYesu yɛ wa tun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Mi onɔ na mata engwafɔ mgban yɛ man i kwulu ma ewo dafi iYesu le gbɔdzɛ yi ongyaa mani. Nghaduu inggisɛ onyi byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ekyɛ ngwi abu mina naadi kyɔnɛ ngwi abu le kponya yi ongyaa baa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Ta ongyaa na dzata ishe eni mgban, yɛ lu igeli ka nya ali inggisɛ duu gbɛɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>&lt;&lt;Ba na, wa di inggisɛ ngwu nya ani alungwɔ ngwi ani plɛ kyɔ tsatsa nɛni. Li iKrestu ma dɛn hoo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>A tasɛ mi ogalu kpatsɛ ofɛ le lu mbon.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Duuse nu ma ba yɔ, engwafɔɔn tɛkyɛ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, gye ungwogye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Nghaduu iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani sulu ungwogye ongwi ema ye ba mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Nɛman engwafɔɔn tole gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Naadi inggisɛ oka kye ungwogye wa nun?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwogye mgbi ani, li okyɔ itukwu mgbi Ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ di ngyɛlu idɔ mgban ngwi o wo ani mani. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Ema li gbɛɛ, &lt;I sisi ofyia enɛ duuse onɔ oshɛ etɔ ka gyɔ baa&gt;? Nin nya ema, kwulu inɛ di okwɔ na! A myɛ gyɔ oshɛ-shɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Onɛnɛ kpaa a le kpa inggisɛ oshɛ etɔ mi idɔ mgban, o dile shɛ etɔ mgbi oshishe ogyegwu na onɛnɛni, ikye ni inggisɛ ofwe etɔ bɛyi inggisɛ oshɛ etɔ wa dzɛ yi atsa yi ewoma. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Nghanɛ elodzɛ ngbɛɛ, &lt;Inggisɛ oka fwe-fwe etɔ oka di shɛ-shɛ na li otsitsi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>N dɔ ema esɔ le ka shɛ etɔ ngwi li ema kya ba. Angbeka teyi kyɔlu idɔ nsunɔ mani ta ema tu mgbede mi idɔ mgbi ama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emi iBatlomi kwuba noyɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Emi iSamaria kwuba mi igeli na nu iYesu oyɛyɛ mi ikye obwɛndɛ mgbi ongyaa nani, ngwi o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O nya ani alungwɔ ngwi ani teyi kyɔ tsatsadu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Nghanɛ ngwi emi iSamaria ba mbon nɛ, a tɛkyɛ nun gbɛɛ no dzɛ yi ama, man o si lela yi ama egbe efa. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Elodzɛ mgban ogbɔɔgbɔ nu inggisɛ kwuba yɛɛ ama onoyɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>A nya ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi noyɛyɛ mi elodzɛ ngwi abu nya eyi na ta ba, onɛnɛ eyi fwo mi adɔ ibeyi, eyi di ye gbɛɛ ongyulɔ nɛ otsitsi-otsitsi o li Onagbɛ mgbi ɛsɛ nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ngyɛlu ongwɛ ongyukwiidɔ <optbreak/> oka ootse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Ngwi egbe efa na nyɛ nɛta iYesu lu iGalalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>(Bana ongwu abuon teyi gbɛɛ oyegbɔ sulu mmwɛ mi ɛsɛ udan ba.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Ngwi o kaka iGalalia nɛman emi iGalalia kyɔn onɔ. A di ungwɔ ama ngwi o kyɔ mi iJerosalin tsatsa mi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi nani, ikyekyɛ ama kpaa kɛ ele.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>O diyɛ kɛ igeli iKana mi ayɛsɛ mgbi iGalalia imbe ngwi o kyata eni yɛɛ eneekwɔ nani. Ongbodzi inggisɛ idɔ mgbi utɔ oka ongwan la ootse mi ɛsɛ iKapenahun. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Ngwi inggisɛ nɛ fwo gbɛɛ iYesu dzata iJudia luba iGalalia nɛ, o si kɛ mbon ka tɛkyɛ nun gbɛɛ no ba wa bwe ongwan ongwu ndotse kaka ikwongye nani.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Nɛ iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Se ni ema di ambɛ yi ungwɔ okwulewo bayɔ ema ka noyɛyɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Ongbodzi inggisɛ idɔ mgbi utɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, ba vla duuse ni ongwani wa kwulu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O ka yagba lu, unka ka kyɔ ongwabu ba.&gt;&gt; Inggisɛ na gbela yi odzɛ ngwi iYesu gbɔ nɛ taman o si lu.<verse eid="JHN 4:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Ngwi o kale kɛ ofɛ mani engbidɔ mgban wa nyan gbɛɛ ewo gbosa lo ongwan. <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>O byi ma onɔ ngwi ewo gbosa lon mani, a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li obyi onyi mi onɔ ngwi awo dzanta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Man otsɔn difwi dafi li onɔ na yɛyɛ ngwi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwabu ka dzɛ oshishe.&gt;&gt; Nɛta ongwu yi etɔ mgban duu noyɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Li ambɛ okwulewo ongwu fan ngwi iYesu kyɔ mi onɔ ngwi o dzata iJudia luba iGalalia aani.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ngyɛlu inggisɛ ootse mi ondu ibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Onɔ oka nɛ, iYesu di yidɔ kɛ iJerosalin mi oga mgbi emi iJuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Ibu mmala dzɛ ogalu iJerosalin ngwi a li kwun di Onufɛ Ogalu Mmala ngwi dzɛ yi iwulu opo nghi eda, iyin mi ondu iHibru li iBɛtesda. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Ibyi inggisɛ ama ndotse lato opo ntonani, ama obinɛ, ama ogbikye tukwu esɛ, bɛyi ama ngwu alewo kwulu. [<verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Ongyesɔ li kyɛ esho wa kaka eni nani, di kyɔ akpeni: inggisɛ ongwu ababɔ nkaka mi onɔ ngwi akpeni le gbo na yɔ, ali ootse mgban duu li ngyɛ.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Inggisɛ oka nose ladzɛ mmanani ngwu dotse onova osudiwyo diwyegyata. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu din ladzɛ mmana di difwi gbɛɛ o dzɛ mi ootse na onɔ kɛ nɛ, o byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I mina abu gbɛɛ ni ootse mgbi abu ngyɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Inggisɛ ootse na si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, ani dzɛ yi inggisɛ onyi nka ya ani abɔ kye ani kaka ibu onɔ ngwi a kyɔ akpeni ba. Ni ani le fya gbɛɛ nin kaka ta inggisɛ oka li teyi ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Nɛ iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyato! Kyi kyelu obutu mgbi abu, kyikyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Labɔlabɔ mata ootse mgban ngyɛ; o kyi kyelu obutu mgban si kyikyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Mi egbe ngwi ungwɔnɛ kyɔ ma li egbe otonyewo, <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>nɛta emi iJuda ntona nya inggisɛ ngwu a ngyɛlun ootse na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li egbe otonyewo; ola fwa gbɛɛ ni abu ka kye obutu mgbi abu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Nghaduu o nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ongwu ngyɛlu ani ootse na nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyi kyelu obutu mgbi abu kyikyɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Nɛ a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ali inggisɛ nya abu gbɛɛ ni abu kyelu obutu mgbi abu kyikyɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Inggisɛ ngwu a ngyɛlun ootse na ye inggisɛ ma ba, ikyekyɛ iYesu lu dzanta kaka ifu ibyi inggisɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Onɔ gwee nɛ iYesu wa din mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dika, abu yɛɛ saan onɛnɛni. Ka kyɔ alobube wuba di ungwɔ ntimbi nghaabɔ nɛ wa kyɔ abu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Inggisɛ na yɛ lu ka nya emi iJuda ntona gbɛɛ li iYesu dzikan ngyɛlu ongwu ootse.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oshishe ikpewo Ongwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Nghanɛ emi iJuda ntona wita opita iYesu mgbɛkyɛ ngwi o ngyɛlu inggisɛ ootse mi egbe otonyewo. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>IYesu si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsani le kyidɔ mgban alonɔ duu, li ngha ngwi ani kpaa le kyɔ aani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Mi ikye odzɛ nɛ emi iJuda ntonɛ fya mi oglijo mgbi ama duu ongwɔn; ikyegbɛɛ o le mbe ola mgbi egbe otonyewo ta ba, kpaa o dile kwu Imgbasho gbɛɛ Otsongwu, okye ewon yɛɛ ungwonyi yi Imgbasho.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfye mgbi Ongwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>IYesu nu ma uka sini: &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, Ongwɛ ka yagba kyɔ unkonyi abuon ba; o ka kyungwɔ ngwi o di Otsɔn le kyɔ ma kyoon ta, bana alungwɔ ngwi Otsɔn kyɔ ma Ongwɛ kpaa li kyɔ ngha yɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Ikyesinɛ Otsɔngwɛ di Ongwɛ kpan itukwu di tson alungwɔ ngwi Ongwu li kyɔ duu. Ɛɛn, ikyegbɛɛ no kwulu ema ewo yɔ, ungwɔ ama nngha ongyɛlu inggisɛ nɛ ootse kpaa, Otsɔn ka kye tson. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Dafi Otsɔn li kyile inggisɛ ikwukwɔ di li kye oshishe nu ma nɛ, li ngha ngwi Ongwɛ kpaa li kye nu ama ngwu ongwu mina okye nu aali. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Nghaduukpaa Otsani li gbɔ inggisɛ onyi ikwɔ ba, o yile ikwɔ ogbɔɔgbɔ duu wo Ongwɛ abɔ, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ikyegbɛɛ nu ma kye mmwɛ nu Ongwɛ dafi a li kye nu Otsɔn kpaa yɛyɛ mani. Inggisɛ nkye mmwɛ nu Ongwɛ ba Otsɔn ndɔn esɔ ma kpaa o nun mmwɛ ba.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>&lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, inggisɛ nfwo elodzɛ mgbi ani di nu ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma oyɛyɛ yɔ, o dzɛ yi oshishe ogyegwu. O dika dzili ba; o fa mi ikwongye luba oshishe. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>N nya ema otsitsi, onɔ kyɛma, i di ba kpaa wa ngwi emi ikwukwɔ ka fwo ela mgbi Ongwɛ Imgbasho, ama nfwo ma ka dzɛ oshishe. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Dafi Otsɔngwɛ dzɛ yi oshishe abuon nɛ, li ngha ngwi o nu Ongwɛ kpaa dzɛ yi oshishe abuon aali. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Nghanɛ o di nun mfye ogbiikwɔ ikyekyɛ o li Ongwɛ Inggisɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>&lt;&lt;No ka kwulu ema ewo mi ungwɔnɛ ba, ikyena onɔ kyɛma ngwi ama nlato endzi duu ka fwo ela mgban <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>di tasɛ mi endzi. Ama nkyɔ osuse ka kyato dzɛ oshishe, ama nkyɔ obube ka kyato kaka odzili-dzili. <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>Ani abuen ka yagba kyɔ unkonyi ba; ani li gbiikwɔ dafi ani fwo ma kyoon, ma ikwɔ mgbi ani li otsitsi, ikyesinɛ ani mina okyungwɔ ongwi itukwu ani ba, kpaa itukwu mgbi ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndɛ mi odzɛ mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>&lt;&lt;Ni ani kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi odzɛ mgbi ani abuani yɔ, obwɛndɛ na wuuta ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Inggisɛ oka dzɛma nli kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi odzɛ mgbi ani, ma ani ye obwɛndɛ mgban li otsitsi.<verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>&lt;&lt;Abu dɛsɔ kɛ mbi iJɔn, o di kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ikye otsitsi. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Li ogbɛɛ Ani mina obwɛndɛ mgbi inggisɛ owamyɛ ba; kpaa Ani gbɔ ntonɛ ikyegbɛɛ ni ema watɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>IJɔn nose dzɛ dafi ipitila nle gbɛ dile gbosa mani, ema dzɛ yi atsa mi ongwonɔ gwee ikye ogbɛ osa mgban.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>&lt;&lt;Ani dzɛ yi obwɛndɛ nsundo ngha mgbi iJɔn nani. Mi ikye idɔ ngwi Otsani kye nu ani gbɛɛ ni ani ngyɛlu nɛni, ngwi ani le kyɔ nɛ, i tso obwɛndɛ gbɛɛ Otsani dɔ ani esɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Otsani ndɔ ani esɔ abuon teyi kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi odzɛ mgbi ani. Ema fwo ela mgban hona di odzɛɛdzɛ mgban ye ba, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>elodzɛ mgban kpaa wodzɛ mbi ema ba, ikyena ema nu ongwu o dɔn esɔ nɛ oyɛyɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Ema kpayi elodzɛ Imgbasho nɛ saan ikyekyɛ ema tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ li mi ele ngwi ema tu oshishe gyegwu. Ma li elodzɛ Imgbasho ntonɛ kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ikye odzɛ mgbi ani, <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>nghaduu ema fwa oba mbi ani wa tu oshishe.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>&lt;&lt;Ani mina mmwɛ mgbi inggisɛ owamyɛ ba, <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>kpaa ani ye ema. Ani ye dafi ema dzɛ yi okpitukwu mgbi Imgbasho mi itukwu mgbi ema ba mani. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Ani ba mi iyi mgbi Otsani, nghaduu ema gbɛ ani ba; kpaa ni inggisɛ oka ba mi iyi mgbi ewon yɔ, ema ka gban. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Ema ka noyɛyɛ sinɛ, ngwi ema le mina mmwɛ mbi ewema, kpaa le pita mmwɛ nkyɛ mbi Imgbasho yuon ta ba?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu ka tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ li Ani ka gbe odzɛ wo ema ewo mbi Otsani ba. Li iMose ngwu ema kye itukwu mgbi ema byi mbon na ka gbe odzɛ wo ema ewo aali. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Ni ema ki nu iMose oyɛyɛ yɔ, ema kika nu ani kpaa oyɛyɛ, ikyesinɛ o lɔ ungwɔ mi odzɛ mgbi ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Kpaa ngwi ema noyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ ngwi o lɔ ba nɛ, ema ka noyɛyɛ mi odzɛ ngwi ani gbɔ sinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu byi inggisɛ idubu eda enbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, iYesu fooye lu byulu mi agya Ekyoo Okwukwo mgbi iGalalia (ngwi a di li kwun di ekyoo iTiberia kpaa nani), <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>nɛ ibyi inggisɛ kpakpa kyɛdɔn ikyekyɛ a di ambɛ okwulewo ngwi o kyɔ mbi emi ootse mani. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Man iYesu tɔ lu unggwɔ ka sisɛ yi emi ongwafɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda dzɛ kwɛkwɛ mi onɔ mani.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Ngwi iYesu kyile inɛ esho di ibyi inggisɛ kpakpa kyɛ le ba mbi ongwu nɛ, o si byi iFyilipi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li mi ole ngwi eyi ka gya ibredi nu inggisɛ ntonɛ gye?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>IYesu byita nɛ ikye ombadun ta, ikyesinɛ o teyi ye mi itukwu mgban ungwɔ ngwi ongwu ka kyɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>IFyilipi nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Udza okpa idɔ mgbi ofyia egyata kpaa ka mɛ ogya ibredi nu ma tsan aba kpatsɛ ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Ongwafɔ mgbi iYesu oka, Andru, ongwunɔ iSaimɔn iPyita si gbɛɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>&lt;&lt;Ongwongyulɔ dzɛ mmɛnɛni ngwu dzɛ yi ibredi ngwi a kyɔ mi ibale nghi eda bɛyi ongwɛ abatsa efa, ntonɛ ka to ole mbi ibyi inggisɛ ntonɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>IYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni inggisɛ ntonɛ sisɛ.&gt;&gt; Oshɛ kyinda mi imbe na kpakpa man inggisɛ ntona sisɛ mi ele, engyulɔ mɛ dafi idubu eda sini. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>IYesu si kyelu ibredi kye angba nu Imgbasho man kye nu engwafɔ mgban nu ma kye gha inggisɛ ntonani, o di kyɔ ngha yi mmbweni yɛyɛ, ama duu gye dafi a mina mani.<verse eid="JHN 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Ngwi inggisɛ duu tu gye gyɔlo ma nɛ, o si nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyi salu ambulu nsisi ma kwakye mbonyi ni unkonyi ka nyanya ba na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>A si kye salu ambulu ibredi ibale nghi eda ngwi a gye sisi ma mbwo uya nghi iwyodefa.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Dafi inggisɛ ntona di ambɛ okwulewo ngwi iYesu kyɔ nɛ, a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mi otsitsi yɔ, nɛnɛ li oyegbɔ nwogyɔ gbɛɛ o ka ba ɛsɛ mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Ngwi iYesu di gbɛɛ, a wewo ogye ongwu utɔ mi abumfye nɛ, o wulɛ lu unggwɔ ka dzɛ yuon.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kyikyɛ mi ikye eni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Mi onɔdɛ nani, engwafɔɔn kɛ utɔ, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>a kaka uwaa le fooye lu iKapenahun dafi imbe yifu wa, kpaa iYesu ba wa tu ma waba. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Awo wa le fa fyumfye, dile gbe akpeni. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Dafi a fa uwaa kɛ mɛ imai eta naadi eta dɔ itsitsi nɛ, a di iYesu kyikyɛ mi ikye eni le ba kwɛkwɛ yi ama, ta imio wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Nghaduu o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li Ani, ka mio ba na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Nɛ a mina okyon kaka uwaa, ntunto nɛta uwaa to ondu esɛ mi imbe ngwi a le kɛ mani.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Tegblifan ibyi inggisɛ ama nto oye utɔ agya oka nɛ difwi gbɛɛ li uwaa onyi ta bɛdzɛ mmana edɛdɛ ma iYesu edɛdɛ kaka yi engwafɔɔn ba, a lu yuoma. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Nɛ uwaa angbeka kyɛ iTiberia wa bɛsɛ kwɛkwɛ yi imbe ngwi inggisɛ ntona gye ibredi mi onɔ ngwi Otsɛ iYesu nose kye angba nu Imgbasho nani. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Ngwi ibyi inggisɛ ntona di gbɛɛ, iYesu naadi engwafɔ mgban to mmana wuba nɛ, a kaka uwaa ntona lu oyombo iKapenahun oka pitan.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ungwogye mgbi oshishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Ngwi a tun mi oyombo utɔ nɛ, a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, li alonɔ ngwi abu to mmɛnɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, ema le pita ani ikyegbɛɛ di ema di ambɛ okwulewo ba, kpaa li ikyegbɛɛ ema gye ungwogye kpakpa tolo. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Ka kyidɔ mi ikye ungwogye nli mbe ba, kpaa mi ikye ungwogye nka dzɛ ba oshishe igyegwu ngwi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka kye nu ema mani, ikyesinɛ Imgbasho Otsɔn teyi kye ambɛ mgbi ogbela ungwɔ nun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Nɛ a byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ ngwi eyi ka kyɔ kyɛmɛ ikye okyidɔ ama ngwi Imgbasho mina?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>IYesu si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Idɔ mgbi Imgbasho ma li ongwu aani: li onoyɛyɛ mbi ongwu Imgbasho dɔn esɔ nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Nghanɛ a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ali ambɛ okwulewo ngwi abu ka kyɔ ikye ni eyi diyɛ nu abu oyɛyɛ? Li alungwɔ ngwi abu ka kyɔ? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Emi otsikyeyi nose gye imana nkyɛ esho kyɛ, mi okwɛsɛ dafi ngwi a tsekise lɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;O kye ungwogye kyɛ esho nu ma gye mani.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, li iMose kye ungwogye nkyɛ esho na nu ema ba, kpaa li Otsani kye ungwogye otsitsi nkyɛ esho na nu ema. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Ikyekyɛ ungwogye mgbi Imgbasho li ongwu nkyɛ esho ba esɛ wa kye oshishe nu ɛsɛ nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, le nu eyi ungwogye na alegbe-alegbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Nɛ iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani li ungwogye mgbi oshishe, inggisɛ nba mbi ani yɔ enbwa ka dɔn wuba, inggisɛ ndi nu ani oyɛyɛ yɔ ekweni ka kwun wuba. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Kpaa dafi Ani nya ema ma, ema di ani wa, nghaduu ema noyɛyɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Ama ngwu Otsani kye ma nu ani duu a ka ba mbi ani, ali inggisɛ ndi ba mbi Ani duu n ka lɔn onya ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Ikyena Ani kyɛ esho ba esɛ owa kyɔ owitukwu mgbi ani ba, kpaa okyɔ owitukwu mgbi ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Ma nɛnɛ li owitukwu mgbi ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma aani: gbɛɛ ama ngwu ongwu gbe nu ani duu onyi kpaa no ka byulu mi ele ba, kpaa ni Ani kyile ma esho mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Lubana owitukwu mgbi Otsani li ogbɛɛ, ali inggisɛ ndi Ongwɛ di nun oyɛyɛ ka tu oshishe gyegwu, Ani dika kyilen mi ikwu mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Mi ungwɔnɛ emi iJuda wita ondandu mi ikye odzɛ mgbi iYesu ikyekyɛ o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li ungwogye nkyɛ esho ba esɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li iYesu lo, ongwɛ iJose, ongwu eyi ye otsɔn yi onɔn nɛ baa? Kyɔsinɛ ngwi o ka gbɔ onɛnɛ gbɛɛ, Ani kyɛ esho ba esɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya ondandu yi ewema na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka ba mbi ani ba se Otsani ndɔ ani esɔ ma kwon ba mbi ani, ani dika kyilen mi ikwu mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ mani. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>A teyi lɔ mi afɛ mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ gbɛɛ: &lt;Imgbasho ka tso ma tsatsa.&gt; Ali inggisɛ ngaadɔ mbi Otsani di kpayi mbon yɔ ka ba mbi ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Inggisɛ onyi kpaa di Otsani ye ba, li ongwu nkyɛ mbi Imgbasho nɛ ta, li ongwu yuon di Otsɔn aali. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>N nya ema otsitsi, inggisɛ nnoyɛyɛ dzɛ yi oshishe gyegwu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Ani li ungwogye mgbi oshishe. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Emi otsikyema gye imana mi imbe okplagada ungwogye nkye esho ba esɛ nani, nghaduu kpaa a kwulu. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Kpaa ungwogye nkyɛ esho ba esɛ dzɛ mmɛnɛni, ngwi inggisɛ ka gye di kwulu wuba. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Ani li ungwogye mgbi oshishe nkyɛ esho ba esɛ. Inggisɛ ta ngye ungwogye nɛ o ka dzɛ oshishe gyegwu, ungwogye nɛ li ikpewo mgbi ani ongwu ani ka kye nu mi ikye oshishe mgbi ɛsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Nɛ emi iJuda ntona wita otangwɛ yi ewoma mi itɔdzɛ ngwi iYesu gbɔ nani, gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi inggisɛ nɛ ka kye ikpewo mgban nu eyi gye?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi se ni ema gye ikpewo mgbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ di wa eyi mgban bayɔ, ema dzɛ yi oshishe mbi ema ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ali inggisɛ ngye ikpewo mgbi ani diyɛ wa eyi mgbi ani dzɛ yi oshishe igyegwu, ani dika kyilen mi ikwu mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ikyesinɛ, ikpewo mgbi ani li ungwogye otsitsi, eyi mgbi ani di li ungwɔ owawa otsitsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Inggisɛ ta ngye ikpewo mgbi ani di wa eyi mgbi ani wodzɛ mbi ani, ani kpaa wodzɛ mbon. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Yɛyɛ dafi Otsani ndzɛ oshishe dɔ ani esɔ mani, ani di dzɛ oshishe li ikye Otsani nani, nghanɛ inggisɛ ngye di wa mbi ani yɔ, ka dzɛ oshishe ikye ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Nɛnɛ li ungwogye nkyɛ esho ba esɛ mani, emi otsikyema gye imana nghaduu a kwulu, kpaa inggisɛ nbyi ewon enbwa yi ungwogye ngwi ani kye nu nɛ, ka dzɛ oshishe gyegwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>IYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ mi onɔ ngwi o le tsungwɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda mi iKapenahun mani.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Engwafɔ mgbi iYesu kwuba dzatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Ngwi a fwo odzɛ nɛ nghanɛ, engwafɔ mgbi iYesu kwuba gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsootso nɛ fyumfye, li emɛ ka gbelan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>IYesu ye dafi engwafɔɔn tole ndandu mi odzɛ nɛni, o si byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Odzɛ nɛ nu ema ka dzani taa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Kini ema di Ongwɛ Inggisɛ yɛ lu esho mi imbe ngwi o teyi dzɛ ma ema ka gbɔsinɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Onodzi mgbi Imgbasho li nu oshishe; mfye mgbi inggisɛ owamyɛ dzɛ yi oyabɔ ba duudu. Elodzɛ ngwi ani gbɔ nya ema ntonɛ li onodzi, a di li oshishe kpaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Nghaduu ema angbeka to ma ngwu noyɛyɛ ba.&gt;&gt; Ikyesinɛ iYesu teyi ye mi owita-wita ama ngwu noyɛyɛ ba mi idzidzɛ ema, yi ongwu nka wa kyen gya mani. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>O kiyayi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ungwɔ ngwi ani nya ema gbɛɛ inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka ba mbi ani ba se Otsani nun ofɛ ma aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Wita mi onɔ na emi ongwafɔɔn kwuba kyata iyikpa di kyɛdɔn wuba.<verse eid="JHN 6:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Nghanɛ iYesu byi engwafɔ mgban iwyodefa ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema kpaa i mina ema odzata anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>ISaimɔn iPyita nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ li mbi emɛ eyi ka kɛ? Abu dzɛ yi elodzɛ mgbi oshishe ogyegwu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Eyi noyɛyɛ di ye gbɛɛ abu li iKrestu, ongwɛ Imgbasho oshishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Nɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani sadu ema nghi iwyodefa baa? Nghaduu onyi mbi ema li olodu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>(O gbɔdzɛ mgbi iJuda ongwɛ Iskarɔti, ikyesinɛ ngwi o li onyi mbi engwafɔɔn nɛ kpaa, o ka wa kye ongwu gya.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Emi ongwunɔ iYesu nun oyɛyɛ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, iYesu kaka iJudia ba kpaa lu le kyikyɛ mi iGalalia, ikyekyɛ ama ogbe emi iJuda teyi le pita ofɛ okyelun oshishe. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Nghaduu ngwi oga iTabenako mgbi emi iJuda wa dzɛ kwɛkwɛ nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>emi ongwunɔ iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I wogyɔ ngwi abu ka dzata imbe nɛ lu iJudia adzi ni emi ongwafɔ abu nu ma di ungwɔ ama okwulewo ngwi abu li kyɔ ntonɛni. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Inggisɛ nmina gbɛɛ ni inggisɛ yon, li kyungwɔ mi odaada ba. Ngwi abu le kyungwɔ ntonɛ wa nɛ, kye ewabu tso ni ɛsɛ di.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Lubana emi ongwunɔn kpaa nun oyɛyɛ ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Ikyenghanɛ iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ mgbi ani yɛyɛ ma gyɔ waba; mbi ema yɔ alonɔ duu le yɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Ɛsɛ ka di ema tanyi ba, kpaa ani yɔ i din tanyi, ikyekyɛ ani kyɔ obwɛndɛ gbɛɛ ungwɔ ngwi o le kyɔ li ibwubwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Ema kɛ oga na. Ani le kɛ oga nɛ waba ikyekyɛ onɔ mgbi ani yɛyɛ ma gyɔ waba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Ngwi iYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ nɛ, o tila dzɛ iGalalia.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Nghaduukpaa, ngwi emi ongwunɔn lu oga nɛman, ongwu kpaa wa kɛ. O kɛ mi ododa ba, kpaa mi odaada. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Mi oga na ma, emi iJuda tole ndinan dile byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O kɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Ibyi inggisɛ ntona tole ndandu kpatsɛ mi ikye mgbi iYesu, angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O li inggisɛ osuse.&gt;&gt; Angbeka nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei o le kpagya inggisɛ wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ gbɔdzɛ mgban mi ododa ba ikyekyɛ a le mio emi iJuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu tsungwɔ mi oga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Onɔ ngwi oga to idzidzɛ ma se, iYesu wa kɛ ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin ka wita ungwɔ otsootso. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>I kwulu emi iJuda ntona ewo man a byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi inggisɛ nɛ ye ungwɔ kpakpa, ma ngwi inggisɛ onyi kpaa tson ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsootso nɛ li mgbi ani ba. Kyɛ mbi Ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Ali inggisɛ ngwu i minan okyɔ itukwu mgbi Imgbasho ka fya oye kana otsootso nɛ kyɛ mbi Imgbasho naadi li mgbi ikyibani. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Inggisɛ nli gbɔdzɛ mgbi ibɔn li kyɔ ngha ikye otu mmwɛ mgbi ewon, kpaa inggisɛ nkyidɔ mi ikye mmwɛ mgbi ongwu ndɔn esɔ ma yɔ li inggisɛ oyɛyɛ; atsika onyi dzɛ mi odzɛ mgban ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>IMose nose kye ola nu ema baa? Nghaduu inggisɛ mgbi ema onyonyi kpaa kyɔ mi ele ba. Kyɔnɛ ngwi ema le fya ongwɔ ani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Inggisɛ ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Esɛ dɔ abu ikye. Li emɛ le fya ongwɔ abu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani kyungwɔ okwulewo onyi kpata, man i kwulu ema duu ewo. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Nghaduu, iMose nu ema ola okyiikyɛ (kpaa li mbi iMose ngwi ola na tɔ ba, li mbi emi otsikyema), ema li kyɛ ongwɛ ikyɛ mi egbe otonyewo. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Kini a ka kyɛ ongwɛ ikyɛ mi egbe otonyewo ikye ofoola mgbi iMose ba waali, kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le kyitingga yi ani gbɛɛ di ani ngyɛlu inggisɛ olɔlɔ ootse mi egbe otonyewo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Ka gbiikwɔ mi ungwɔ ngwi ema di ma kyoon ba, gbiikwɔ mi ungwɔ nli emyɛmyɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Li iKrestu ma dɛɛn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Mi onɔ na ma inggisɛ angbeka mi iJerosalin wita obyi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ongyulɔ ngwu a le fya ongwɔn ma lo? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>O dzɛ mmɛnɛ, le gbɔdzɛ mi ododa ma a le kwondu won ba, ama ogbe eyi teyi difwi gbɛɛ o li iKrestu ma waa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kpaa eyi ye imbe ngwi inggisɛ nɛ tɔkyɛ; onɔ ngwi iKrestu ma wa ba yɔ, inggisɛ onyi ka ye imbe ngwi o tɔkyɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Ta ngwi iYesu kale tso mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho nɛ, o gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, ema ye ani, ema di ye imbe ngwi ani kyɛ mani. Ani dzɛ mmɛnɛ ikyibani ba, ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma li otsitsi. Ema yon ba, <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>nghaduu ani yon ikyekyɛ ani kyɛ mbon o di dɔ ani esɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Nɛ a fya obwan, kpaa inggisɛ onyi yagba okye abɔ gbon ba ikyekyɛ onɔ mgban gyɔ waba. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Inggisɛ kwuba mi ifu ibyi kye oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ama byi mbon kpɔɔ. A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni iKrestu ma wa ba yɔ, o ka kyɔ ambɛ ama nghao kwulewo ngha inggisɛ nɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Dafi emi iFarasi fwo ibyi inggisɛ tole ndandu mi ungwɔ ntonɛ mi ikpewo iYesu nɛ, engyukwo ama ofifɛ bɛyi emi iFarasi dɔ ama ongyo ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin gbɛɛ nu ma ka bwa iYesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ka dzɛ yi ema ongwonɔ gwee ta, man N ka yɛ lu mbi Ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Ema ka pita ani, kpaa ema ka tu ani ba; imbe ngwi ani dzɛ kpaa ema ka kɛ gbɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Emi iJuda ntona gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li mi ole ngwi inggisɛ nɛ weka olu ngwi eyi ka din ba? O ka lu imbe ngwi emideyi ganya to mi idzidzɛ emi iGriki ma, dika tso emi iGrikii? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Oweka mgban sinɛ ngwi o gbɛɛ, &lt;Ema ka pita ani, kpaa ema ka tu ani ba, ma imbe ngwi ani dzɛ ema dika ba gbɛ ba&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ bɛyi egbe ingblimɔ mi oga na ma iYesu dzɛkunto, di gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni ekweni kwu inggisɛ yɔ, non ba wa wa mbi ani. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Ali inggisɛ nnu ani oyɛyɛ dafi Afɛ gbɔ ma, ifogbe mgbi eni oshishe ka fɛ tɔ mbon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Mi odzɛ nɛ iYesu kye inɛ byi Onodzi Osaan ngwi ama nnu ongwu oyɛyɛ ka wa gbɛ mani. Nghataa ba onɔ na a kye Onodzi ma nu waba, ikyekyɛ iYesu kaka okwɔkwɔ oshewo mgban ma waba.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Onɔ ngwi ibyi inggisɛ ntona fwo odzɛ ngwi o gbɔ nɛ angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsitsi-otsitsi, inggisɛ nɛ li Oyegbɔ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O li iKrestu mani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Angbeka di byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IKrestu ka tɔ mi iGalalia sinɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Afɛ gbɛɛ iKrestu ka tɔ mi etɔ mgbi iDevedi mi iBɛtlɛhɛn, ogalu ngwi iDevedi dzɛ bawɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Itɔdzɛ nɛta inggisɛ ntonɛ si gha ikye iYesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Angbeka mina obwan, nghaduu inggisɛ onyi kye abɔ gbon ewo ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyɛyɛ onuunu ba mgbi engyukwo <optbreak/> emi iJuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Ongyɛɛngyɛ yɔ ama ongyo ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin yidɔ kɛ mbi engyukwo ama ofifɛ yi emi iFarasi, a byi ama ongyoongyo ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛ ngwi ema kye iYesu ba mmɛnɛ ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Ama ongyoongyo ntona nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onyonyi yama gbɔdzɛ dafi ngwi inggisɛ nɛ gbɔ ye ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Emi iFarasi byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema tso gbɛɛ, ema kpaa o kpagya ema woo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>&lt;&lt;Ama ogbe inggisɛ teyi hona emi iFarasi onyi nun oyɛyɛ yee? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Ei! Kpaa ibyi inggisɛ ama n ye unkonyi mi ola mgbi iMose ba ntonɛ, ikamba dzɛ ikye ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>INikodemu, nteyi kɛ mbi iYesu, di li onyi mboma ma byita gbɛɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>&lt;&lt;Ola mgbi eyi noofɛ gbɛɛ ni eyi fwo mbi inggisɛ ba ta ngwɔn ikwɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>A si nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kpaa kyɛ iGalaliaa? Tsɛwɛ mi ele, ta abu ka difwi gbɛɛ oyegbɔ li tɔ mi iGalalia ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Ta ali inggisɛ duu lu udɛ mgban.]<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ongyaa ngwu a bwan mi amah</para>
  <para style="p">[<verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Ta iYesu lu Unggwɔ Olivi. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Tegblifan mi egbegbe ototu nɛ, o diyɛ lu ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin nani, inggisɛ duu kwakye kpaklili won, man o si sisɛ otso ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Etsetse mgbi ola mgbi iMose bɛyi emi iFarasi kye ongyaa ngwu a bwan mi amah ba. A non dzɛkunto mi inɛ ibyi ntona <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>si nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, a bwa ongyaa nɛ le kyɔ amah. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Mi ola ma iMose nu eyi ofɛ otsɛngwɔ itɔ ongyaa nɛ mi akwutsɛ, ma abu gbɔ dikyɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>A tole byun ita nɛ ikye okyan ukya di tu itɔdzɛ okye abɔ byi ele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Kpaa iYesu klɛsɛ wita olɔ ungwɔ mi esɛ mi ongwufabɔ mgban. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Dafi a kiyayi obyun ita nɛ, o kyile ikye esho si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni inggisɛ onyi mi idzidzɛ ema kyungwɔ obube ye bayɔ, otsungwɔ no li ababɔ otsan ikwutsɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>O diyɛ klɛsɛ wita olɔ ungwɔ mi esɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Mi odzɛ nɛ, ama nfwo ma wita olu onyonyi, ama nli engyukwo ma teyi, nghataa wa sisi iYesu yi ongyaa na ka kwuzunto mi imbe nani. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>IYesu kyile ikye esho byi ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa, a kɔ? Inggisɛ onyi kpaa sisi onu abu obube wulo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onyi kpaa ba, ongyukwo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">IYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngyɛse, ani kpaa nu abu obube ba. Lu kpaa ka kyɔ alobube wuba.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olɔɔlɔ emi tugbe angbeka sulu ambulu nɛ ba: 7:53--8:11.</char></note>]<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu li osa mgbi ɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>IYesu di gbɔdzɛ yi inggisɛ ntonɛni, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li osa mgbi ɛsɛ. Ali inggisɛ nkyɛdɔ ani yɔ o ka yama kyikyɛ mi iifu ba, kpaa o ka dzɛ yi osa mgbi oshishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Emi iFarasi si kwun shanyɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kwudzɛ mmɛnɛ le kyɔ ewabu obwɛndɛ; obwɛndɛ mgbi abu wuuta ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>IYesu si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni Ani kyɔ ewani obwɛndɛ kpaa, obwɛndɛ mgbi Ani wuuta, ikyekyɛ Ani ye imbe ngwi Ani tɔkyɛ bɛyi imbe ngwi Ani le kɛ mani. Nghaduu ema dzɛ yi ozoyeye mi imbe ngwi Ani tɔkyɛ hona le kɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Ema li fwikwɔ mi odzɛɛdzɛ mgbi inggisɛ owamyɛ; kpaa Ani li fwo inggisɛ onyi ikwɔ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Ma ni ani gbiikwɔ yɔ, ikwɔ ogbɔɔgbɔ mgbi ani ka li ayin, ikyesinɛ ani dzɛ yuen ba. Ani dzɛ yi Otsani, ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Mi ola mgbi ema ma a lɔ gbɛɛ obwɛndɛ mgbi inggisɛ efa li wuuta. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Ani li ongwu nkyɔ ewani obwɛndɛ; obwɛndɛ mgbi ani oka li Otsani, ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>A si byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsabu kɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema ye ani hona Otsani ba. Ema ki ye ani yɔ, i kika ye Otsani kpaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>IYesu gbɔdzɛ ntonɛ mi onɔ ngwi o le tsungwɔ mi akangga ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin kwɛkwɛ yi imbe ngwi a li kye umba wokɛ nani. Nghaduu inggisɛ onyi bwan ba, ikyekyɛ onɔ mgban gyɔ waba.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Akpe oka nɛ, iYesu di nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani le lu, ma ema ka pita ani, i dika kwulu mi alobube mgbi ema. Imbe ngwi ani le lu ma, ema ka yagba kɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Odzɛ nɛ nu emi iJuda ntona byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O ka ngwɔ ewoon? Li ungwɔ ma ngwi o gbɛɛ, &lt;Imbe ngwi ani le lu ma ema ka ba gbɛ ba daa&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Nghaduu iYesu kiyayi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema kyɛ mi esɛ; ani kyɛ mi esho. Ema li emi ɛsɛ nɛni; ani li emi ɛsɛ nɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Ani teyi nya ema gbɛɛ ema ka kwulu mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ema; kini ema noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ ani li ongwu ani gbɛɛ ani dzɛ ma bayɔ, ema ka kwulu otsitsi mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>A byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li emɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li itɔ inggisɛ ngwu ani teyi nya ema gbɛɛ ani dzɛ mani. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Ani dzɛ yi odzɛ kpakpa ofwo ema ikwɔ mi ele. Kpaa ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma li otsitsi, odzɛ ngwi ani fwo mbon ma n li kye nya ɛsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>A yagba difwi gbɛɛ o le nya ma odzɛ mgbi Otsɔn ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Nghanɛ iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi ema kyile Ongwɛ Inggisɛ desho mata, ema ka ye gbɛɛ Ani li inggisɛ ngwu ani tso gbɛɛ di Ani dzɛ mani. Ani dika kyɔ unkonyi mgbi ikyibani ba kpaa Ani li gbɔ ungwɔ ngwi Otsani tso Ani ma yɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma dzɛ yi ani; o dzata ani yuen ba, ikyesinɛ Ani li kyungwɔ nli kpan alonɔ duu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Ngwi o gbɔ elodzɛ ntonɛnɛ, inggisɛ kwuba nun oyɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsitsi ka shɛ abu adi ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Mbi emi iJuda ama nnun oyɛyɛ ma, iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni ema kwudzɛ mi otsootso mgbi ani yɔ, ema li ama okyɛdɔ ani yɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Ema ka ye otsitsi, ta otsitsi ka shɛ ema adi ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>A nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi li etɔ mgbi Abrahan, eyi li ofyɛɛ mgbi inggisɛ onyi ye ba. Kyɔsinɛ ngwi abu dika gbɛɛ a ka shɛ eyi adi ta?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, inggisɛ nle kyɔ alobube tayɔ li ofyɛɛ mgbi alobube. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Ofyɛɛ dzɛ yi imbe igyegwu mi etɔ ba, kpaa ongwɛ li mgbi etɔ gyegwu. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Nghanɛ ni ongwɛ shɛ ema adi ta yɔ, ema ka shɛta otsitsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Ani ye ema li etɔ mgbi Abrahan. Nghaduu ema wewo ongwɔ ani, ikyekyɛ elodzɛ mgbi ani wodzɛ itukwu mbi ema ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Ani le nya ema ungwɔ ngwi ani di mi inai Otsani, ema di li kyungwɔ ngwi ema fwo mbi otsema mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>A nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abrahan li otseyi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni ema ki li emi ongwɛ Abrahan yɔ, ema kile kyungwɔ ngwi Abrahan kyɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Ngwi i dzɛ nɛ, ema weka ongwɔ ani, ikyegbɛɛ ani nya ema otsitsi ngwi ani fwo mbi Imgbasho mani. Abrahan kyɔ itɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Ema le kyungwɔ ama ngwi otsema teyi kyɔn mani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi li ofyɛɛ ba. Otsɔ ngwi eyi dzɛyan li Imgbasho abuon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emi ongwɛ Owapɛ olodu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni Imgbasho ki li Otsema yɔ, ani kika kpema itukwu, ikyesinɛ ani kyɛ mbi Imgbasho badzɛ mmɛnɛ onɛnɛ aani. Ani ba mgbi ikyibani ba; kpaa li ongwu dɔ ani esɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le difwi odzɛ ngwi ani le gbɔ ba? Li ikyegbɛɛ ema le gbela odzɛ ngwi ani le gbɔ ba mani. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Ema li mgbi otsema, Olodu, di mina ema okyɔ oweka mgbi otsema. O li inggisɛ ogbɔngwɔ inggisɛ mi owita-wita ma jo, o kwudzɛ mi otsitsi ba, bana otsitsi dzɛ mbon ma ba. Mi onɔ ngwi o mwonya ma, o li gbɔdzɛ mi odzɛɛdzɛ mgban, bana o li inggisɛ omwonya di li otsɛ mgbi onya omwaamwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Nghaduu ikyegbɛɛ ani nya ema otsitsi nɛ, ema nu ani oyɛyɛ ba! <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Inggisɛ mgbi ema onyi ka yagba tso abɔ mi obube mgbi ani wɛ? Ni ani le nya ema otsitsi ma, i kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema nu ani oyɛyɛ ba? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Ongwu nli mgbi Imgbasho li fwon. Itɔdzɛ ngwi ema li fwo ba ma li ikyegbɛɛ ema li mgbi Imgbasho ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yi Abrahan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>A byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi gbɔ ayin mi ogbɛɛ abu li inggisɛ iSamaria esɛ di dɔ abu ikye ba naadi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Esɛ dɔ ani ikye ba, kpaa Ani nu Otsani mmwɛ nghaduu ema nu ani mmwɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Ani le pita okwɔkwɔ mi ikye ewen ba; kpaa inggisɛ dzɛma ngwu pitan, di li ongwu li ongye ogbiikwɔ aali. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>N nya ema otsitsi, kini inggisɛ ngyo elodzɛ mgbi ani yɔ, o ka di ikwongye inɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Mi ikye odzɛ nɛ emi iJuda ntonɛ kwulu ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ eyi ye gbɛɛ esɛ dɔ abu ikye otsitsi! Abrahan kwulu, li ngha ngwi ama ogbɛɛsɛ kpaa kwulu aali, nghaduu abu gbɛɛ ni inggisɛ ngyo elodzɛ mgbi abu yɔ, o ka di ikwongye inɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Abu shewo ngha otseyi Abrahan? O kwulu, li ngha ngwi ama ogbɛɛsɛ kpaa kwulu aali. Abu tsɛwɛ di abu li emɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni Ani nu ewani okwɔkwɔ yɔ, okwɔkwɔ mgbi ani na wuuta ba. Otsani, ongwu ema li gbɛɛ o li Imgbasho mgbi ema na, li ongwu nu ani okwɔkwɔ aali. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Ema yen ba, kpaa Ani yen. Kini Ani gbɛɛ di Ani yen bayɔ, n ka li inggisɛ omwonya dafi ema mani, nghaduu Ani yen di ngyo elodzɛ mgban. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Otsema Abrahan dzɛ yi atsa mi ɛwɛ otsɛɛtsɛ odi egbe obaaba mgbi ani; o di egbe na diyɛ dzɛ yi atsa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Emi iJuda ntona nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu mɛ onova ngwusefa dɔn iwyo kpaa waba, ta abu di Abrahan ye!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>IYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Duuse nu ma mba Abrahan yɔ, ani plɛ dzɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Mi itɔdzɛ nɛ, a sa akwutsɛ gbɛɛ a ka tsan, kpaa iYesu kye ewon da, wulɛ tasɛ dzata ikpɛsɛ mgbi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin nani.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kwulu inggisɛ nbinɛ kyɛ ifu inɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Dafi iYesu kyikyɛ le kɛ nɛta, o di ongyulɔ ongwu nbinɛ kyɛ ifu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Engwafɔɔn byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, li emɛ kyɔ obube, inggisɛ nɛ naadi ama omban, ngwi a mban binɛ kyɛ ifu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Nɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li inggisɛ nɛ naadi ama omban kyɔ obube ba, kpaa ungwɔnɛ kyɔ ikyegbɛɛ idɔ mgbi Imgbasho no tso ambɛ mi oshishe mgban. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Dafi onɔ ka desho nɛ, li kyɛmɛ ngwi eyi ka kyidɔ mgbi Ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ nani. Otu kyɛma, ngwi inggisɛ onyi ka kyidɔ wuba. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Ngwi Ani ka dzɛ ɛsɛ nɛ nɛ, Ani li osa mgbi ɛsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ ngha nɛ, o kyanggwɔ tokɛsɛ, o bwili ekyɛ mi anggwɔ si kye gyuwo ongyulɔ na inɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="IYesu kwulu inggisɛ nbinɛ kyɛ ifu inɛ" file="DN00447b.tif" size="col" loc="9;6" copy="Dunhan" ref="9:6">Jesus heals a man born blind</figure> <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>O nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lu, ka ngwunɛ mi uta mgbi iSilon&gt;&gt; (ita iyi nɛ gbɛɛ deesɔ). Nɛta ongyulɔ na lu ka ngwunɛ, si yɛ luba udɛ le dinɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Ama nwatse udɛ dɔn bɛyi ama nteyi li din le bibɔ ma byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ongyulɔ nli teyi sɔ le bibɔ nɛ lo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Angbeka gbɔgbɛɛ, li ongwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei, o lun luulu ta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Nghaduu ongwu abuon le kali-kali gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani ma aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Nɛ a byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛse inɛ mgbi abu kwulu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyulɔ ngwu a kwun di iYesu na bwili ekyɛ kye gyuwo ani inɛ. O nya ani gbɛɛ ni ani lu iSilon ka ngwunɛ. Dafi ani lu ka ngwunɛ nɛtaman, ani si dinɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>A byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ma kɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ye ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emi iFarasi kya mi odzɛ inɛ <optbreak/> okwulu-kwulu nani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>A kye ongyulɔ nbinɛ na ba mbi emi iFarasi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Egbe ngwi iYesu bwili ekyɛ kwulu ongyulɔ na inɛ ma, li egbe otonyewo. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Nghanɛ emi iFarasi kpaa di byun ita dafi i kyɔ se ngwi inɛ mgban kwulu mani. Inggisɛ na nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O bwili ekyɛ kye gyuwo ani inɛ, ani ka ngwunɛ taman n sile di aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Emi iFarasi angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ kyɛ mbi Imgbasho ba, bana o wɛ egbe otonyewo ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Nghaduu angbeka byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛse inggisɛ alobube ka kyɔ ambɛ okwulewo ngha?&gt;&gt; Ikyenghanɛ a si gheefa.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Mi ongyɛɛngyɛ ma a diyɛ kyata byi inggisɛ obinɛ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu ma, o gbɔsinɛ ikpewon? Li inɛ mgbi abu ngwi o kwulu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Inggisɛ na nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O li oyegbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Emi iJuda noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ di inggisɛ na teyi binɛ se inɛ wa kwulu lon ba, mbise ngwi a dɛsɔ mbi ama omban. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>A byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ongwɛ emaa? Li ongwu ema gbɛɛ di a mban binɛ kyɛ ifu ma dɛɛn? Kyɔnɛse ngwi o le di onɛnɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Ama omban nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi ye o li ongwɛ eyi, eyi di ye o binɛ kyɛ ifu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Nghaduu eyi ye dafi i kyɔ se o le dinɛ onɛnɛ ba, naadi eyi ye inggisɛ nkwulun inɛ ba. Byun na. O li ongbɛ wuba; o ka gbɔdzɛ ikye ewon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Ama omban gbɔdzɛ nɛ ikyekyɛ a le mio emi iJuda, bana emi iJuda teyi bwalu ondu gbɛɛ inggisɛ ta nnoyɛyɛ gbɛɛ iYesu li iKrestu yɔ, a ka dulun tɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Li ikyengha ngwi ama omban gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O li ongbɛ wuba; byun na aali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Akpe ongwu fan, a kwu inggisɛ nteyi binɛ kyɛ ifu na ela. A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye oshewo nu Imgbasho, eyi ye inggisɛ nɛ li inggisɛ alobube.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>O si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini o li inggisɛ alobube hona o li inggisɛ alobube ba kpaa, ani ye ba. Ungwɔ onyi ngwi ani ye yɔ. Ani teyi binɛ, kpaa onɛnɛ ani le di!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Nghanɛ a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O kyɔsinɛ yi abu? O kwulu abu inɛ sinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani teyi nya ema kpaa ema gadɔ ba. Li alungwɔ mina ema odi fwo? Ema mina oyɛɛ engwafɔɔn naadi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Ta a wulun ito di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li ongwafɔ mgbi inggisɛ nɛni! Eyi yɔ, eyi li engwafɔ mgbi iMose! <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Eyi ye gbɛɛ Imgbasho gbɔdzɛ yi iMose, kpaa inggisɛ nɛ yɔ, eyi yama ye imbe ngwi o tɔkyɛ kpaa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Ongyulɔ na nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔnɛ li ungwɔ okwulewo! Dafi ema ye imbe ngwi o tɔkyɛ ba, kpaa o kwulu ani inɛ nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Eyi ye dafi Imgbasho li fwo odzɛ mgbi emi ali ibwubwe ba mani. O li fwo odzɛ mgbi inggisɛ oyɛyɛ ongwu nle kyɔ oweka mgban. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Kyɛ onɔ ngwi a ta ɛsɛ nghataa ba onɛnɛni, inggisɛ onyi kpaa fwo gbɛɛ a kwulu inggisɛ ongwu nbinɛ kyɛ ifu inɛ ye ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ongyulɔ nɛ ki kyɛ mbi Imgbasho bayɔ, o ki kyɔ unkonyi gbɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Mi elodzɛ nɛ a nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A mba abu yi alobube kyɛ ifu; kyɔnɛse ngwi abu le tso eyi!&gt;&gt; Man a tsamun tasɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inɛ obu mi onodzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>IYesu si fwo dafi a tsamun tasɛ mani, ngwi o wa tun nɛ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu noyɛyɛ mbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ joo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ongyulɔ na byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O li emɛ, ongyukwo? Nya ani zukwu ni ani wa nun oyɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>IYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ abu din; mi otsitsi, li ongwu nle gbɔdzɛ yi abu nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ongyulɔ na gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ani noyɛyɛ,&gt;&gt; man o sunun.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ba ɛsɛ nɛ ikye ikwɔ ogbɔɔgbɔ, ikyegbɛɛ obinɛ non di, ama ntole di ma nu ma yɛɛ obinɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Emi iFarasi angbeka nto yan ma fwon le gbɔ ngha nɛta, a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ekyɛgbɔɔ? Eyi kpaa binɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Nɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini ema li obinɛ yɔ, ema ki gye obube mi alobube ba; kpaa onɛnɛ ngwi ema le tso gbɛɛ ema le dinɛ nɛ, alobube mgbi ema ka dzɛ yi ema.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ ongyo mmala osuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>&lt;&lt;Mi otsitsi-otsitsi yɔ, n le nya ema, inggisɛ ongwu nkaka mi onufoka mgbi ifatoba mmala ba, kpaa ka tɔ kaka mi ofɛ angbeka yɔ, o li emumyi bɛyi inggisɛ ofofɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ nkaka mi onufɛ li inggisɛ ongyo mmala. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Inggisɛ ongyoongyo li kwulu onufoka, mmala li fwo ela mgban. O li kwu mmala mgban ela mi iyi, di li gbe ma tasɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Mi onɔ ngwi o gbe ama nli mgban tsatsa tasɛ ma, o li teyi ofɛ, man mmala mgban di li kyɛdɔn, ikyekyɛ a ye ela mgban. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Kpaa a ka yama kyɛdɔ ingyoga ba; otsitsi, a ka tsinyan ikyesinɛ a yagba difwi ela mgbi ingyoga ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>IYesu gbɔ itaodzɛ nɛni, kpaa ungwɔ ngwi o le nya ma gbosa lo ma ba.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Nghanɛ iYesu diyɛ gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N le nya ema otsitsi, ani li onufoka mgbi mmala. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Ama nteyi ani ba duu li emumyi bɛyi ama ofofɛ, nghaduu mmala fwo ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Ani li onufɛ; ali inggisɛ nkaka nyɛ mbi ani yɔ, o ka watɔ. O ka kaka tasɛ, di tu ungwogye. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Emumyi li ba ikye owa yi di ngwɔ diyɛ dzili; ani ba gbɛɛ nu ma tu oshishe, di tuun dzii.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>&lt;&lt;Ani li inggisɛ ongyo mmala osuse mani. Inggisɛ ongyo mmala osuse li kye oshishe mgban lasɛ ikye mmala mgban. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Inggisɛ ngwu a kyon idɔ ongyo mmala yɔ, mmala li mgban ba. Nghanɛ onɔ ngwi o di idukwlɛbɛ kyɛ le ba ma, o li dzata mmala ntona tsinya lu. Ta idukwlɛbɛ li ba wa kwu mmala di ganya ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Inggisɛ na tsinya ikyekyɛ o li inggisɛ ngwu a kyen kyeekye idɔ ta unkonyi won yi mmala ntona ba.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>&lt;&lt;Ani li inggisɛ ongyo ifyungwɔ osuse; ani ye mmala mgbi ani, mmala mgbi ani kpaa ye ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Dafi Otsani ye Ani, Ani kpaa di ye Otsani mani, Ani di kye oshishe mgbi Ani nu mi ikye mmala. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Ani dzɛ yi mmala angbeka ama nwoto ifatoba yi ama ntonɛ ba. Ama kpaa li kyɛmɛ ngwi ani ka gbe ma ba. Ama kpaa ka fwo ela mgbi ani dika yɛɛ obyi ifyungwɔ onyi yi inggisɛ ongyo ifyungwɔ onyi. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Itɔdzɛ ngwi Ani kpa Otsani itukwu yɔ, li ikyegbɛɛ Ani kye oshishe mgbi Ani nu, ikye odi yidɔ kyi kyelu. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka yagba gbɛ Ani oshishe ba, Ani ka kye nu abuani. Ani dzɛ yi mfye okye nu di dzɛ yi mfye okyi kyelu. Ola nɛ Ani gbɛ mbi Otsani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Mi ikye elodzɛ ntonɛ, emi iJuda di dzɛ yi ogbua-gbua yi ewoma. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Ama kwuba gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Esɛ dɔn ikye o dile wede. Kyɔnɛ ngwi eyi le gadɔ mbon?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Nghaduu angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Elodzɛ ntonɛ li mgbi inggisɛ ngwu esɛ dɔn ikye ba. Emɛsɛ ka yagba kwulu obinɛ inɛ gbɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emi iJuda fwa iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Li onɔ oga owɛ-wɛ mgbi okye ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin dubɔ Imgbasho. Li mi onɔ ofu, <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>nɛ iYesu le kyikyɛ mi akangga ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, mi iwulu onufozu mgbi iSolomu nani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Emi iJuda kwakye kpakɛkɛ won, le gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kye onɔ sinɛ ngwi abu kale tsili-tsili eyi ngha? Kini abu li iKrestu ma yɔ, nya eyi mi ododa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani nya ema, kpaa ema noyɛyɛ ba. Ungwɔ ama okwulewo ngwi Ani kyɔ mi iyi mgbi Otsani nɛ, gbɔ odzɛɛdzɛ mgbi ani, <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>nghaduu ema noyɛyɛ ba ikyekyɛ ema li mmala mgbi ani ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Mmala mgbi ani li fwo ela mgbi ani; ani ye ma, a di li kyɛdɔ ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Ani nu ma oshishe gyegwu, a dika dzili wuba; inggisɛ onyi kpaa dika lafwa ma mi abɔ mgbi ani ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Otsani, nkye ma dɔ ani ubɔ ma, shewo ngha ali inggisɛ duu; inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka lafwa ma mi abɔ mgbi Otsani ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Ani yi Otsani eyi li onyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Emi iJuda di kye akwutsɛ gbɛɛ a ka tsan, <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>nghaduu iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani tso ema ungwɔ okwulewo ama nshewo kwuba mbi Otsani. Li ikye ole mi efu ngwi ema ka tsɛ ani akwutsɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Emi iJuda gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi le tsɛ abu akwutsɛ mi ikye ungwɔ ntonɛ onyi kpaa ba, li mi ikye ito ofya Imgbasho, ikyesinɛ abu nli inggisɛ owamyɛ nɛ, le tso gbɛɛ abu li Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>IYesu si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A lɔ mi ola mgbi ema gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani gbɛɛ ema li emi imgbasho baa&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Ki non kwu ma di emi imgbasho ma, li mbi ele ngwi elodzɛ Imgbasho ba, ngwi Afɛ ka yagba nyinɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Ongwu Otsɔn dulu-dulu dafi li mgban abuon di kye dɛsɔ ba ɛsɛ nɛ mayɛ? Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema dulu ongwufabɔ mbi Ani gbɛɛ Ani le fyito ikyekyɛ ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani li Ongwɛ Imgbasho&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Ni Ani le kyidɔ mgbi Otsani bayɔ, ka nu ani oyɛyɛ ba na. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Kpaa ni ani le kyɔ yɔ, ni ema nu ani oyɛyɛ ba kpaa, nu idɔ okwulewo ntona oyɛyɛ na, ikye ni ema ye diyɛ difwi dafi Otsani dzɛ mbi ani, ani kpaa di dzɛ mbi Otsani mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>A di fya obwan, nghaduu o dzidzɛ tɔ mi abɔ ma lu.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Ta iYesu yidɔ foyombo iJodan lu imbe ngwi iJɔn teyi le kyɔ iBatisima ababɔ mani. O ka dzɛkɛ ele. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Inggisɛ di ba mbon kpakpa. A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;iJɔn kyɔ ambɛ okwulewo onyi ba, kpaa alungwɔ ngwi iJɔn gbɔ mi ikye ongyulɔ nɛ duu li otsitsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Inggisɛ kwuba si nu iYesu oyɛyɛ mi imbe nani.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Ikwu iLadzaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Onɛnɛ inggisɛ ngwu a li kwun di iLadzaru dotse. O kyɛ mi iBetani, mi agwɔ mgbi iMeri bɛyi ongwunɔn iMata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>IMeri nɛ, li ongwu ongwunɔn iLadzaru onɛnɛ ladzɛ esɛ mi ootse aani, di li ongwu kpɔɔ ka wa kye engyie ogbungbɛ kyi iYesu afɔ di kye fɔlu mi otu mgban. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Nghanɛ emi ongwunɔn engyaa deesɔ mbi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ongwu nkpaabu itukwu na dotse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Mi onɔ ngwi iYesu fwo ungwɔnɛ mata, o gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ootse nɛ ka ngyɛ mi ikwongye ba. Ei, li mi ikye okwɔkwɔ mgbi Imgbasho adzi ni Ongwɛ Imgbasho tu okwɔkwɔ mi ele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>IYesu di iMata yi ongwunɔn ongwu ongyaa bɛyi iLadzaru kpan itukwu. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Nghaduu, ngwi o fwo gbɛɛ iLadzaru dotse nɛ, o diyɛ dzɛ imbe ngwi o dzɛ na egbe efa kpɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Ta o nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Yidɔ kɛ iJudia na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, li enggeengga ngwi emi iJuda fya otsɛ abu akwutsɛ, nghanɛ abu diyɛ le kɛ imbe naa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Obyi li iwyodefa mi egbe baa? Inggisɛ nkyikyɛ mi onɔ ka tsiishi ba, ikyekyɛ o li di osa ongwi ɛsɛ nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Li mi onɔ ngwi o kyikyɛ mi otu mata ngwi o li tsiishi, ikyekyɛ osa dzɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ nyɛ nɛ, o kiyayi onya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Okeyi iLadzaru nuna, kpaa n le kɛ ele oka kyilen una.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Engwafɔɔn nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ki non nuna yɔ, o ka tu iyu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>IYesu le gbɔdzɛ ikwu mgbi iLadzaru, kpaa engwafɔɔn tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ o le gbɔdzɛ una onana mgbi atta nɛni.<verse eid="JHN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Nɛta o si nya ma mi ododa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;ILadzaru kwulu, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>ma mi ikye mgbi ema yɔ, ani dzɛ yi atsa dafi ngwi ani dzɛ ele ba mani, ikyegbɛɛ ni ema noyɛyɛ. Nghaduu i kɛ ka din na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Nɛ iTɔmɔsu (ngwu a li kwun gbɛɛ ongwɛ efa na), nya engwafɔ mgbi iYesu angbeka ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba ni eyi kpaa kɛ na, adzi ni eyi ka kwulu biyan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gyila emi ongwunɔn engyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>IYesu ka kaka, dafi a kye iLadzaru ndzi mɛ egbe enɛ wa. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Okyɛɛ mi iJerosalin ba iBetani sisi gwee omɛ imai efa, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>emi iJuda kwuba di ba mbi iMata yi iMeri owa gyila ma mi ikwu ongwunɔ ma.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Ngwi iMata fwo dafi iYesu kyɛ nɛta, o tasɛ oka kpatsan, nghaduu iMeri tila dzɛ udɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>IMata nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ni abu ki dzɛ mmɛnɛ yɔ, ongwunani ki kwulu ba. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Nghaduu ani ye gbɛɛ mi onɛnɛ kpaa Imgbasho ka kyɔ abu alungwɔ ngwi abu bɔ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>IYesu si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwunabu ka yɛ kyɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>IMata gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ye o ka yɛ kyɛɛ mi okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwu mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwu bɛyi oshishe. Inggisɛ nnu ani oyɛyɛ yɔ, o ka dzɛ oshishe, yeba non kwulu kpaa; <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>ma inggisɛ ta ndzɛ oshishe di nu ani oyɛyɛ ka kwulu ba. Abu noyɛyɛ mi odzɛ nɛ wɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>IMata nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, Otsɛ, ani noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ abu li iMedzaya, Ongwɛ Imgbasho, ongwu nka ba ɛsɛ nɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ nyɛ mata, o yidɔ kwu ongwunɔn iMeri ela kɛ enggengga gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse dzɛ mmɛnɛni, o le pita abu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Ngwi iMeri fwo ungwɔnɛ nɛ, o kyato vla kɛ mbi iYesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Mi onɔ na iYesu kaka ogalu na waba, kpaa o ka dzɛ imbe ngwi iMata ka tun nani. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Ngwi emi iJuda ama nbato yi iMeri mi udɛ, le gyilan na, di dafi o kyato vla tasɛ nɛta, a si kyɛdɔn, tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ o le lu endzi ka tsukwu mi ele.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Ngwi iMeri ka to imbe ngwi iYesu dzɛ di din mata, o gbɛsɛ lankɛ iyayi di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ni abu ki dzɛ mmɛnɛ yɔ, ongwunani ki kwulu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Ngwi iYesu din le tsukwu, yi emi iJuda ama nbato yan ntona kpaa tole tsukwu nɛ, itukwu mu lon mi onodzi i di kakan ewo. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>O byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema kyon da mi ole?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba wa di, Otsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>IYesu tsukwu.<verse eid="JHN 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Ta emi iJuda gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Di dafi o kpan itukwu maa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Nghaduu angbeka mi efu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwu nkwulu obinɛ inɛ nɛ kyɔnɛ ngwi o kyi ndɛlu ikwu inggisɛ nɛ wuba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kyile iLadzaru mi ikwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Dafi itukwu nghao fu-fu lo iYesu nɛ, o kɛ endzi. Li endzi olo ngwi a di kye ikwutsɛ tukwu ondufan. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mulu ikwutsɛ nɛni.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">IMata, ongwu ongwunɔn kwulu na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaa, Otsɛ, mi onɛnɛ o ka li odikyi, lubana o la endzi egbe enɛ waani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Nɛta iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani teyi nya abu gbɛɛ kini abu noyɛyɛ yɔ, abu ka di okwɔkwɔ mgbi Imgbasho baa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Ta a kyi mulu ikwutsɛ nani. Nɛ iYesu kyile inɛ esho, si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsani, Ani ta abu angba dafi abu fwo (ibɔ mgbi) ani wa mani. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ani ye dafi abu li fwo (ibɔ mgbi) Ani alonɔ mani, kpaa n le gbɔdzɛ nɛ mi ikye abɔ oyaaya mgbi inggisɛ ama nkwudzɛ to mmɛnɛ nɛni, ikye nu ma noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ di abu dɔ ani esɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ mata, iYesu kwu ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;ILadzaru, tasɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Inggisɛ ikwukwɔ na si tasɛ, yi ayangwuto ngwi a kye ndiwon afɔ yi abɔ, yi ongwi a kye bwan inɛ mani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Man iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɛlun angwuto ikwɔ na non lu.&gt;&gt;<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus raise Lazarus from death" file="dn00458.jpg" size="col" loc="11:44" copy="dn" ref="11:44">iYesu kyile iLadzaru mi ikwu</figure><verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A wibu ongwɔ iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Nɛ emi iJuda ibyibyi ama nba angba ikwu mbi iMeri, di ungwɔ ngwi iYesu kyɔ nɛtaman, a nun oyɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Nghaduu angbeka mi efu lu mbi emi iFarasi ka dakwɔ ungwɔ ngwi iYesu kyɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Nɛ okwukwo inggisɛ ama ofifɛ bɛyi emi iFarasi kwu ela okwakye mgbi osɔɔsɔ mgbi ama ogbiikwɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">A byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ ngwi eyi ka kyɔ? Inggisɛ nɛ le kyɔ ambɛ ama okwulewo kwuba. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Kini eyi dzatan le kiyayi ngha yɔ, ali inggisɛ duu ka wa nun oyɛyɛ, nghanɛ emi iRoma ka ba wa kyi gbɛlu imbe mgbi eyi bɛyi ɛsɛ mgbi eyi kpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Ta onyi mi ifu ma, iyin di iKayafa, ongwu li okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ mi onova nani, nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema ye unkonyi ba duu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ema yama difwi gbɛɛ i tatase ni inggisɛ onyi kwulu mi ikye ibyi inggisɛ ngha ogbɛɛ ni ɛsɛ mgbi eyi duu dzili ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Li mi owitukwu mgban ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ ba, kpaa li dafi o li okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ mi onova na mani, o gbɔ ela oyegbɔ gbɛɛ iYesu ka kwulu mi ikye ɛsɛ mgbi iJuda duu, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>dika li ikye mgbi ɛsɛ na ta ba kpaa ka li mi ikye engwɛ mgbi Imgbasho ama nganya ntona mi oyile ma luba mbonyi di nu ma yɛɛ onyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Nɛ i wita mi egbe na lu iyayi, a wibu ongwɔ iYesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Nghanɛ iYesu di kyikyɛ mi ododa mi idzidzɛ emi iJuda wuba. Kpaa o lu ayɛsɛ ndzɛ kwɛkwɛ yi okwɛsɛ, mi agwɔ ngwi a li kwun di iFrɛn nani, ka dzɛ efu yi engwafɔɔn.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Ngwi onɔ oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda dzɛ kwɛkwɛ nɛ, inggisɛ kwuba le lu iJerosalin ikye oka fwɔ ewo duuse ni oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ wa gyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>A kale pita iYesu, dafi a kwudzɛ to mi akangga ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin nɛ, a le byi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema le tsɛwɛ sinɛ? O ka ba Oga nɛ ba naadi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Nghaduu engyukwo ama ofifɛ bɛyi emi iFarasi teyi noola gbɛɛ kini inggisɛ ye imbe ngwi iYesu dzɛ yɔ, non gbɔ adzi nu ma ka bwan.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">A kye engyie kyi iYesu mi iBetani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Ngwi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda sisi egbe egyin nɛ, iYesu si kaka iBetani, imbe ngwi iLadzaru ongwu iYesu kyilon mi ikwu dzɛ nani. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>A kyɔ oga ongwi onɔdɛ ikye mmwɛ mgbi iYesu mi imbe nani. IMata gbe oga nu, iLadzaru kpaa sɔdzɛ adinyatsɛ ogye ungwogye yi iYesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Nɛ iMeri kyi kyelu ikpen engyie olɔlɔ ongwi fyunfyummya saan kye tulu kyi iYesu afɔ. Di kyi fɔlu yi otu mgban, man mmgbɛ mgbi engyie na kyi gbɛlu ozu sɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Kpaa engwafɔ mgbi iYesu onyi, iJuda Iskarɔti ongwu nka wa kyon gya ma byita gbɛɛ, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>&lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi a kye engyie nɛ gya kye awuya na gha emi adzɛ ba? I mɛ udza okpa idɔ onova olɔlɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>O gbɔdzɛ nɛ ikyegbɛɛ di o kye emi adzɛ wuuta ba, kpaa li ikyegbɛɛ o li emumyi; ngwi o li inggisɛ okye ashiko da nɛ, o li ya ewon abɔ mi ungwɔ ngwi a kye wokɛ ele mani.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dzanta kɛ. O kye engyie nɛ dzɛkɛ mi ikye egbe owa ndzi ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Ema ka dzɛ yi emi adzɛ mi idzidzɛ ema alonɔ duu, kpaa ema ka dzɛ yi ani alonɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ibyi inggisɛ emi iJuda difwi gbɛɛ iYesu dzɛ imbe nani man a ba, mi ikyon ta ba kpaa owa di iLadzaru, ongwu iYesu kyilon mi ikwongye nani. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Nɛ engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ yi oweka okyi ngwɔlu iLadzaru kpaa, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>lubana mi ikye mgbi iLadzaru emi iJuda kwuba le dzata engyukwo mgbi ama yɛ nu iYesu oyɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kaka mi oglijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Tegblifan ibyi inggisɛ kpakpa ama nba oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda fwo gbɛɛ iYesu kye ofɛ dikye le ba iJerosalin nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>a gbe abaade tasɛ oka tun, le gbaakwɔ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Osana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">Mse no bɛ Inggisɛ ngwu ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">mi iyi mgbi Otsɛ ewo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Mse no bɛ Utɔ mgbi emi Israi ewo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>IYesu tu ongwɛ itaklimyi dɔkɛ ele, dafi a teyi lɔ mi afɛ gbɛɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>&lt;&lt;Ka mio ba na, engwengwengyaa mgbi iDzayɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">dii, utɔ mgbi abu kyɛ aali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">o dɔdzɛ ongwɛ itaklimyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Mi ababɔ ma engwafɔ mgban difwi ungwɔ ntonɛ ba. Li onɔ ngwi a nu iYesu okwɔkwɔ nyɛ ma se, a kuma difwi gbɛɛ ungwɔ ngwi a kyɔn ntonɛ, Afɛ plɛ lɔ dzɛ esɛ ikyon.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Ikyenghanɛ ibyi inggisɛ ama nto yan mi onɔ ngwi o kwu iLadzaru ela tasɛ mi endzi di kyilon mi ikwu ma, kiyayi okye elodzɛ na gbɔfwɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Ikyegbɛɛ inggisɛ kwuba fwo ambɛ okwulewo ngwi o kyɔ nɛ, a tasɛ oka tun. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Nɛ emi iFarasi gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii, ungwɔnɛ le kye eyi kɛ mbeka ba. Di dafi ɛsɛ duu kyɛdɔn mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔdzɛ ikwu ewon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Emi iGriki angbeka kɛ oka sunu mi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda nani. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>A ba mbi iFyilipi, ongwu kyɛ mi iBɛtsaida mi iGalalia na, yi imina. A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, i mina eyi odi iYesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>IFyilipi si kɛ ka nya Andru; Andru yi iFyilipi diyɛ lu ka nya iYesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Obyi ngwi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka gbɛ okwɔkwɔ ma gyɔ wa. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>N nya ema otsitsi, ni inɛnekwu ngwuta lakɛ esɛ ma ni i bwa bayɔ, ka li inɛnɛ onyi kpɔɔ; kpaa non bwa yɔ, ka mba kwuba. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Inggisɛ ndi oshishe mgban kpan itukwu yɔ, oshishe na ka nyanya lon, kpaa ongwu ndi oshishe mgban tan anyi mi ɛsɛ nɛ yɔ, ka kyon kaka oshishe ogyegwu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Ali inggisɛ nkyɔ ani idɔ ka kyɛdɔ ani kyɛmɛ; imbe ngwi ani dzɛ ma, ongbidɔ mgbi ani kpaa ka dzɛ ele. Otsani ka nu ongwu nli kyɔ ani idɔ ma mmwɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>&lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ itukwu mgbi Ani dzɛ mi okakewo, ma li alungwɔ ngwi ani ka gbɔ? Nin gbɛɛ, &lt;Otsani, dulu Ani tɔ mi obyi nɛɛ&gt;? Ei, li mi itɔdzɛ nɛ yɛyɛ ngwi Ani kaka obyi nɛ aani. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Otsani, kye okwɔkwɔ nu iyi mgbi abu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:28">Ta ela tɔ mi esho gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N kye okwɔkwɔ nu mi ele wa, ma n dika nun okwɔkwɔ kpɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Ibyi inggisɛ ama nto mmana ma fwo ungwɔ na di gbɛɛ akpala gbo; angbeka gbɛɛ ongyesɔ gbɔdzɛ yan.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ela nɛ ba mi ikye mgbi ani ba, kpaa li mi ikye oyabɔ mgbi ema. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Onɛnɛ li onɔ ngwi a ka gbɔ ɛsɛ nɛ ikwɔ, li onɛnɛ ngwi a ka lɔ ongwuutɔ ongwu ɛsɛ nɛ onya tɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Nghaduu Ani, onɔ ngwi a wa kyile Ani esho mi ɛsɛ nɛ yɔ, N ka kwo inggisɛ duu ba mbi ani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>O gbɔ ungwɔnɛ ikye otso itɔ ikwu ngwi ongwu ka wa kwu mani.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Ibyi inggisɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi fwo mi Afɛ gbɛɛ iMedzaya ma ka dzɛ gyegwu, ma kyɔnɛ ngwi abu ka gbɛɛ, &lt;A ka kye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ lu esho kyɛmɛ&gt;? Li emɛ li Ongwɛ Inggisɛ nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>IYesu si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema ka wa tu osa mi ongwonɔ mi iyayi. Kyikyɛ mi onɔ ngwi ema ka dzɛ yi osa nɛni, duuse ni otu wa to tu ema. Inggisɛ nli kyikyɛ mi iyifu li ye imbe ngwi o le kɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Ema noyɛyɛ mi osa ngwi ema ka dzɛyan nɛni, ikye ni ema wa yɛɛ emi ongwɛ osa.&gt;&gt; Ngwi o ngyɛlu odzɛ ogbɔɔgbɔ mata, o si lu ka da.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emi iJuda fwa onu iYesu oyɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Ambɛ ama okwulewo ngwi iYesu kyɔ mi inai ma nɛ kpaa, a nun oyɛyɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Ungwɔnɛ kyɔ ikye ombwumbwo elodzɛ mgbi oyegbɔ Adzaya ngbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;Otsɛ, li emɛ noyɛyɛ mi esɔ mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">di li emɛ ngwu mfye mgbi Otsɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">tso tɔ ododa mbon?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Li mi itɔdzɛ nɛ ngwi a yagba noyɛyɛ ba aali, ikyena, dafi Adzaya kpaa gbɔ mbeka ma gbɛɛ:<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>&lt;&lt;O tukwu ma inɛ di nu itukwu mgbi ama tiishu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nghanɛ a ka di mi inɛ mgbi ama wuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">naadi difwi mi itukwu mgbi ama ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">hona kyatitukwu ni ani bwe ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Adzaya gbɔdzɛ nɛ ikyekyɛ o di okwɔkwɔ mgbi iYesu di gbɔdzɛ mi efu.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Nghaduu mi onɔ na kpɔɔ angbeka kwuba mi idzidzɛ ama ogbe inggisɛ teyi nun oyɛyɛ. Kpaa mi ikye mgbi emi iFarasi a yama gbɔ oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ama tasɛ esɛ ba, ikyesinɛ a le mio gbɛɛ a wa dulu ma tɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Lubana a mina otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi inggisɛ ngha otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi Imgbasho.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>IYesu gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni inggisɛ nu ani oyɛyɛ yɔ, li ani ta ngwi o noyɛyɛ ba, kpaa o nu ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma oyɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Inggisɛ ndi ani yɔ, o di ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Ani ba ɛsɛ nɛ dafi osa, ikyegbɛɛ ali inggisɛ ongwu nu ani oyɛyɛ yɔ non ka dzɛ mi iifu ba.<verse eid="JHN 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>&lt;&lt;Mbi inggisɛ ongwu nfwo elodzɛ mgbi ani kpaa ngyo ma bayɔ, ani gbɔn ikwɔ ba. Bana ani ba owa gbɔ ɛsɛ ikwɔ ba, kpaa owa dulun tɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Ikwɔ dzɛ mi ikye mgbi ongwu nfwa ani diyɛ gbɛ elodzɛ mgbi ani ba mani; elodzɛ ngwi ani gbɔ na kpɔɔ ka ngwɔn ikwɔ mi egbe ongwi olɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Bana ani le gbɔdzɛ mgbi ikyibani ba, kpaa li Otsani ndɔ ani esɔ ma wo ani ola mi ungwɔ ngwi ani ka gbɔ yi itɔ ofɛ ngwi ani dika gbɔn mani. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Ani ye gbɛɛ ola mgban li nu oshishe gyegwu. Nghanɛ alungwɔ ngwi ani gbɔ yɔ le yɛyɛ yi ungwɔ ngwi Otsani nya ani gbɛɛ ni ani gbɔ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu sa engwafɔɔn afɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Duuse nu ma wa gye oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda. IYesu ye dafi onɔ mgban ngyɛ owa dzata ɛsɛ nɛ yɛ lu mbi Otsɔn. Ngwi ama nli mgban kpan itukwu ka to ɛsɛ nɛ nɛ, o si tso ma okpitukwu mgban ngyɛ klɛklɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Dafi a sɔ ungwogye ongwi onɔdɛ nɛman, Olodu tu iJuda Iskarɔti ongwɛ iSaimɔn wo, owa kye iYesu gya. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>IYesu ye dafi Otsɔn nun mfye mi alungwɔ duu mani, di ye dafi ongwu kyɛ mbi Imgbasho dile yɛ lu mbi Imgbasho mani. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Nɛ o kyato mi ita ungwogye fwadulu angwuto ongwi esɛ kye oshata to oshi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>O kyi mwalu eni wokɛ okye wita le sa emi ongwafɔɔn afɔ, yile oshata na fwɔ ma afɔ.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>O wa to mbi iSaimɔn iPyita, ongwu nbyun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, abu ka sa ani afɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ ema yama ye ungwɔ ngwi ani le kyɔ nɛ waba, kpaa ema ka wa ye mi iyayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>IPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei, o ka yama sa ani afɔ ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini ani sa abu afɔ bayɔ, abu wo atɛ yi ani ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>ISaimɔn iPyita si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngyɛse, Otsɛ, no ka li afɔ ta ba, sa ani abɔ yi ikye kpaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nteyi shuwo yɔ i wogyɔ ngwi o ka saafɔ ta; ikyekyɛ ewo mgban duu teyi le saan wa. Ema le saan, kpaa li ema duu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Bana iYesu ye otsungwɔn nka wa kye ongwu gya mani, li ngha ngwi o gbɛɛ li ema duu le saan ba aali.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Dafi o sa ma afɔ ngyɛ nɛ, o yile angwuto wo yɛ luba imbe mgban. O si byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema difwi ungwɔ ngwi ani kyɔ yi ema nɛ wɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ema li kwu ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Otsetse&gt; yi &lt;Otsɛ&gt; li ayin yɛyɛ, li ungwɔ ngwi ani dzɛ aali. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Onɛnɛ ngwi ani, Otsɛ yi Otsetse mgbi ema, sa ema afɔ nɛ, ema kpaa ka yɛ sa ewema afɔ ngha. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>N tso ema ambɛ ngha ikye ni ema kyɔ dafi ani kyɔ yi ema nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>N nya ema otsitsi ongbidɔ yama dzɛ yi oshewo ngha ongyukwo mgban ba, naadi ongyesɔ ngha ongwu ndɔn esɔ ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Ngwi ema ye ungwɔ ntonɛ onɛnɛ nɛ, ema ka tu mse kini ema kyɔ ma yɔ.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu plɛ gbɔ dafi a ka wa kye ongwu <optbreak/> gya mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>&lt;&lt;N yama le gbɔ yi ema duu ba; n ye ama ani sadu mani. Nghaduu nɛnɛ li ikye ni ungwɔ ngwi a lɔ dzɛ Afɛ gbɛɛ: Ongwu nkye abɔ wo uga yi ani nɛ ka yile iga fyi yɛn na no mbwumbwo.<verse eid="JHN 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>&lt;&lt;N le nya ema onɛnɛ duuse no wa kyɔ, ikyegbɛɛ no wa kyɔ yɔ ema ka noyɛyɛ mi itɔ inggisɛ ngwu Ani dzɛ mani. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>N nya ema otsitsi, ali inggisɛ ngbɛ inggisɛ ngwu ani dɔn esɔ tayɔ gbɛ ani; ma inggisɛ ta ongwu gbɛ Ani yɔ gbɛ ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>IYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ ngyɛ man i kakan ewo mi onodzi ta o kyɔ obwɛndɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, onyi mbi ema ka wa kye ani gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Engwafɔɔn ndinɛ di ewoma, ikye ni ama difwi inggisɛ ngwu o le gbɔdzɛ na ikyen mani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Oka mi idzidzɛ ma, ongwafɔ nkpa iYesu itukwu, sɔ dɔn. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>ISaimɔn iPyita kyɔ ongwu nkpa iYesu itukwu na abɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Byun li emɛ ngwi o le gbɔdzɛ na yan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>O kye ewo ge iYesu kɛ, si byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ li emɛni lo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ongwu ani ka kye anggayɛ ibredi nɛ ba kye nun mani.&gt;&gt; Nɛ, o kye anggayɛ ibredi na ba, kye nu iJuda Iskarɔti, ongwɛ iSaimɔn nani. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Ntunto ngwi iJuda kye gbɛlu ibredi nɛman, iSatan si kaka mbon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔ nwo abu owa kyɔ ma, kyɔn plɛ-plɛ tsatso!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ onyi mi ita ungwogye difwi ungwɔ nkyɔ se ngwi iYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ yan ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Dafi iJuda li utɔ igbe nɛ, angbeka tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ iYesu le nyan gbɛɛ no ka gya ungwɔ ngwi ama ka wa kyɔ aboyaaya ele mi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda, hona kye ungwɔ nu emi adzɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Labɔlabɔ ngwi iJuda kyi gbɛlu ibredi nɛta, o tɔ lu esɛ. Ma li mi otu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔ dafi iPyita ka wa tangwɛ <optbreak/> ongwu mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Ngwi iJuda tɔ lu nɛ, iYesu gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ Ongwɛ Inggisɛ tu okwɔkwɔ wa, Imgbasho kpaa tu okwɔkwɔ mbon. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Kini Imgbasho tu okwɔkwɔ mbon yɔ, Imgbasho ka nu Ongwɛ okwɔkwɔ mbi ewon, dika nu okwɔkwɔ ma akponyi.<verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>&lt;&lt;Ɛngbɛ mgbi ani, ani ka dzɛ yi ema onɔ gblɔgɔdɔ wuba. Ema ka pita ani, dafi n nya emi iJuda ma n dile nya ema onɛnɛ ngha yɛyɛ: Imbe ngwi ani le kɛ ma, ema ka ba gbɛ ba.<verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>&lt;&lt;Ani le wo ema ola ofufɛ: Kpa ewema itukwu na. Dafi ema kpa ani itukwu nɛ, li ngha ema kpaa ka kpa ewema itukwu aali. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Ni ema le kyɔ ngha yɔ inggisɛ duu ka ye gbɛɛ ema li engwafɔ mgbi ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>ISaimɔn iPyita byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, li mi ole ngwi abu le kɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Imbe ngwi ani le kɛ ma, ema ka kyɛdɔ onɛnɛ gbɛ ba, nghaduu ema ka wa kyɛdɔ mi onɔ ongwi iyayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>IPyita byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, kyɔsinɛ ngwi ani ka yagba kyɛdɔ abu onɛnɛ gbɛ ba? Ani ka kye oshishe mgbi ani nu mi ikye abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>IYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mi odzimɔ abu ka kye oshishe mgbi abu nu mi ikye anii? N nya abu otsitsi, ogbigbi ka teela waba ta, abu ka tangwɛ ani akpe eta!<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kwu engwafɔɔn ɛwɛ wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>&lt;&lt;Ka nu itukwu kaka ema ewo ba. Nu Imgbasho oyɛyɛ; di nu ani kpaa oyɛyɛ na; <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Mi udɛ Otsɛn ozu kwuto; ki li ngha bayɔ, n ki nya ema. Ani le lu ele oka yile imbe mɛ ikye ema. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Ni Ani ka yile imbe mɛ ikye ema yɔ, n ka yɛ wa gbe ema ka dzɛ yi Ani adzi imbe ngwi Ani dzɛ ma ema kpaa ka dzɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Ema ye ofɛ okɛ imbe ngwi ani le lu mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu li ofɛ okɛ mbi Otsɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>ITɔmɔsu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, eyi ye imbe ngwi abu le kɛ ba, ma ka kyɔsinɛse eyi ka ye ofɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li ofɛ yi otsitsi bɛyi oshishe. Inggisɛ onyi ka yagba kɛ mbi Otsani ba se o ka nyɛ mbi ani. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ema ki ye ani saan yɔ, ema kika ye Otsani kpaa. Wita onɛnɛ lu iyayi, ema yon di din waani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>IFyilipi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, tso eyi Otsabu mani ta sika gyɔlo eyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;iFyilipi, ngwi Ani dzɛ yi ema onɔ gblɔgɔdɔ nɛ kpaa abu ye ani lo? Ali inggisɛ ndi ani yɔ li Otsani ma ngwi o di. Kyɔsinɛ ngwi abu gbɛɛ, &lt;Tso eyi Otsani ma&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Abu noyɛyɛ dafi Ani dzɛ mbi Otsani, Otsani kpaa di dzɛ mbi ani baa? Elodzɛ ngwi Ani le nya ema nɛ li mgbi ani abuen ta ba. Kpaa li Otsani ndzɛ mbi ani ma, le kyidɔ mgban aani. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Nu Ani oyɛyɛ dafi Ani gbɛɛ Ani dzɛ mbi Otsani, Otsani kpaa di dzɛ mbi ani nɛni; hona ni i ndɛ sinɛ-sinɛ kpaa ema noyɛyɛ mi ambɛ mgbi ungwɔ okwulewo ntonɛni. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>N nya ema otsitsi, ali inggisɛ ndzɛ yi oyɛyɛ onuunu mbi ani ka kyungwɔ ama ngwi Ani teyi le kyɔ ntonɛni. O ka kyungwɔ ama nngha ntonɛ kpaa, ikyekyɛ n le lu mbi Otsani. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>N ka kyɔ alungwɔ ngwi ema bɔ mi iyi mgbi ani duu, adzi ni Ongwɛ kye okwɔkwɔ nu Otsɔn. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ema ka yagba bɔ alungwɔ duu mi iyi mgbi ani, n dika kyɔ ema ele.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu zondu Onodzi Osaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>&lt;&lt;Kini ani kpa ema itukwu yɔ, ema ka ngyo ola ngwi Ani wo ema mani. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>N dika bɔ Otsani, ta o ka nu ema Ongye okwu ema ɛwɛ wo oka, ongwu nka dzɛ yi ema gyegwu mani, <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Onodzi mgbi otsitsi nani. Ɛsɛ ka gban ba, ikyekyɛ o yon hona din kpaa ba. Nghaduu ema yon, lubana o dzɛ yi ema dika wo mbi ema kpaa. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>N ka dzata ema dafi ongwokwu ba; n ka yɛ ba mbi ema. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Mi ongwonɔ gwee ɛsɛ ka di ani wuba, kpaa ema yɔ ka di ani. Ikyesinɛ Ani dzɛ oshishe, ema kpaa ka dzɛ oshishe. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Mi egbe na ema ka wa difwi dafi ani dzɛ mbi Otsani, ema wo mbi ani, ani di wo mbi ema mani. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Ali inggisɛ ndzɛ yi ola mgbi ani di li ngyo ma yɔ, li ongwu ani kpan itukwu. Inggisɛ ani kpan itukwu yɔ o ka kpa Otsani itukwu, ani kpaa o dika kpa ani itukwu, n dika kye ewani tson.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Ta iJuda (li mgbi Iskarɔti na ba) gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, kyɔsinɛse ngwi abu witukwu okye ewabu tso ɛsɛ ba ngwi li eyi ta?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini ani kpa inggisɛ itukwu yɔ, o ka kyɛdɔ otsootso mgbi ani. O dika kpa Otsani itukwu, eyi dika ba mbon wa dzɛyan. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Inggisɛ ngwu ani kpan itukwu bayɔ, o ka kyɛdɔ otsootso mgbi ani ba. Elodzɛ ngwi ema li fwo ntonɛ li mgbi ani ba; a li mgbi Otsani ndɔ ani esɔ mani.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>&lt;&lt;Ani le nya ema ungwɔ ntonɛ duu ngwi ani ka dzɛ yi ema nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Kpaa Ongye okwɛwɛwo, Onodzi Osaan, ngwu Otsani ka kye dɛsɔ mi iyi mgbi ani na, ka tso ema ungwɔ duu diyɛ wɛ ema alungwɔ ama ngwi ani teyi gbɔ nya ema duu. <verse eid="JHN 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>N dzata iyu yi ema; n kye iyu mgbi ani nu ema. N kye nu ema dafi ɛsɛ li nu ma ba. Ka nu itukwu sha ema anyɛ ba dika tsimio ba na.<verse eid="JHN 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>&lt;&lt;Ema fwo dafi ani gbɛɛ, &lt;N le lu mbeka n dika yɛ ba mbi ema mani.&gt; Ni ani kpa ema itukwu yɔ, ema ka tsatsa gbɛɛ Ani le lu mbi Otsani, lubana Otsani shewo ngha Ani. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>N nya ema onɛnɛ duuse no wa kyɔ, ikyegbɛɛ no wa kyɔ yɔ, ni ema noyɛyɛ mani. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>N ka gbɔdzɛ yi ema gblɔgɔdɔ wuba, lubana ongwuutɔ ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ kyɛma. O dzɛ yi mfye mbi ani ba, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>kpaa ɛsɛ no ye kyɛmɛ gbɛɛ Otsani kpa ani itukwu, ani di li kyungwɔ ngwi Otsani wo ani ola ma yɛyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt;Kyato; ni eyi lu dzata imbe nɛ na.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekwɔ eneekwɔ yi abɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>&lt;&lt;IYesu nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ: Ani li ekwɔ eneekwɔ otsitsi, Otsɛn li inggisɛ ogbinɛbyi ekwɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>O li kyi dzɛlu ali abɔ ndzɛ mbi ani wa owawa ba ma ngwuta, kpaa o li kye gbɔmbɔ akyikyen mi abɔ ngwi wa owawa mani, ikye no kiyayi owa awawa kwuba. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Ema teyi le saan mi ikye elodzɛ ngwi Ani plɛ gbɔ nya ema nani. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Kwudzɛ mbi ani na, ta Ani kpaa ka kwudzɛ mbi ema. Abɔ ka yagba wa owawa ikyibɔn ba, sede o ka kwokyi mi iteekwɔ kyɛmɛ. Ema kpaa ka yagba wa owawa ba sede ni ema kwudzɛ mbi ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>Ani li ekwɔ eneekwɔ ema li abɔ. Kini inggisɛ kwudzɛ mbi ani yɔ, ani kpaa ka kwudzɛ mbon, o ka wa awawa nghaabɔ ogbugbe; ni li Ani bayɔ ema ka kyɔ unkonyi gbɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Ali inggisɛ nkwudzɛ mbi ani bayɔ, o dzɛ dafi abekwɔ ngwi a kyi fwɛlu ngwuta non ngwɔ mani; itɔ abekwɔ ntona a li sa ma wokɛ ola nu ma gyola. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Kini ema kwudzɛ mbi ani elodzɛ mgbi ani kpaa di dzɛ mbi ema yɔ, ema ka bɔ alungwɔ ngwi ema mina duu a ka kye nu ema. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ungwɔnɛ li ikye onu Otsani okwɔkwɔ, ogbɛɛ ni ema wa awawa nghaabɔ ogbugbe, nu ma di difwi gbɛɛ ema li engwafɔ ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Dafi Ani kpa Otsani itukwu nɛ, li ngha ngwi ema kpa ani itukwu aali, onɛnɛ kwudzɛ mi okpitukwu mgbi ani na. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Kini ema ngyo ola mgbɛn yɔ, ema ka kwudzɛ mi okpitukwu mgbɛn, dafi ani kpaa ngyo ola mgbi Otsɛn di kwudzɛ mi okpitukwu mgban nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Ani nya ema ungwɔnɛ ikye ni atsa mgbi ani dzɛ mbi ema, adzi ni atsa mgbi ema mbwumbwo. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ola mgbi Ani ma li ongwu aani: Di ewema kpa eka itukwu dafi ema kpa Ani itukwu nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Inggisɛ onyi dzɛ yi okpitukwu ngwi she ngha ongwunɛ ba, ogbɛɛ inggisɛ kye oshishe mgban lasɛ mi ikye mgbi emi okaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Ema li emi okani kini ema ngyo ola ngwi ani wo ema yɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Ani kwu ema gbɛɛ engbidɔ wuba, ikyesinɛ ongbidɔ ye ungwɔ ngwi ongyukwo mgban li kyɔ ba. Nghanɛ, n kwu ema gbɛɛ emi okani, bana alungwɔ ngwi ani kpayi mbi Otsani duu ani nu ema ye. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Li ema dulu Ani ba, kpaa Ani dulu ema di wo ema idɔ gbɛɛ ni ema lu ka wa owawa nka li gyegwu. Ta Otsani ka nu ema alungwɔ ngwi ema pita mi iyi mgbi ani duu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Nɛnɛ li ola ngwi ani wo ema: Di eka kpa eka itukwu na.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsɛ di engwafɔ tanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>&lt;&lt;Kini ɛsɛ di ema tanyi yɔ, wɛ gbɛɛ i tsekise di ani tanyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Kini ema li mgbi ɛsɛ yɔ, ema kika kpan dafi ema li mgban mani. Dafi i dzɛ nghanɛ, ema li mgbi ɛsɛ nɛ ba, kpaa ani dulu ema tɔ mi ɛsɛ. Li ikyengha ngwi ɛsɛ di ema tanyi aali. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Wɛ odzɛ ngwi ani tsekise gbɔ yi ema gbɛɛ: &lt;Ongbidɔ onyi shewo ngha ongyukwo mgban ba nani.&gt; Kini a gbɔ ani odzɛ ewo yɔ, a dika gbɔ ema kpaa ngha. Kini a sunu otsootso mgbi ani, a ka sunu otsootso mgbi ema kpaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>A ka kyɔ yi ema mi itɔ ofɛ nɛ mi ikye iyi mgbi ani, ikyesinɛ a ye Ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ni ani ki teyi ba wa gbɔdzɛ yi ama bayɔ, a kika dzɛ yi obube mi alobube mgbi ama ba. Nghaduu onɛnɛ nɛ ema ka yagba natsondu mi obube mgbi ema wuba. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Inggisɛ ongwu ndi ani kyili di Otsani kpaa kyili. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Ni ani ki kyɔ mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama ungwɔ ngwi inggisɛ oka teyi kyɔ mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama ye bayɔ, a kika dzɛ yi obube mi alobube mgbi ama ba. Kpaa onɛnɛ a di ungwɔ ama okwulewo ntonɛ duu, nghaduu kpaa a di ani kyili yi Otsani duu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Nghaduu nɛnɛ li ombwumbwo ungwɔ ngwi a lɔ mi Ola mgbi ama gbɛɛ: &lt;A di ani kyili mi itɔdzɛ ba nani.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>&lt;&lt;Ni ongye Okwɛwɛwo, Onodzi mgbi otsitsi ntɔkyɛ mbi Otsani ongwu ani ka wa dɔn esɔ mbi ema ma, wa ba yɔ, o ka kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ikye ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Li kyɛmɛ ema kpaa ka kyɔ obwɛndɛ, ikyesinɛ ema dzɛ yi ani kyɛ mi owita-wita.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>&lt;&lt;Ungwɔ ntonɛ duu Ani tsekise nya ema ikyegbɛɛ ni ema ka boofɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>A ka wa dulu ema tɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda; mi otsitsi, onɔ kyɛma ngwi ali inggisɛ ngwu ngwɔ ema duu ka tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ ongwu le kyɔ Imgbasho idɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>A ka kyɔ itɔ ungwɔ ntonɛni ikyesinɛ, a ye Otsani hona ani ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Ani tsekise nya ema ungwɔ ntonɛni, ikyegbɛɛ ni onɔ ma wa gyɔ ema ka wɛ gbɛɛ ani tsekise kwo ema adɔ. Ani nya ema ungwɔnɛ mi ababɔ ma ba, ikyekyɛ ani ka dzɛ yi ema.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɔ mgbi Onodzi Osaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>&lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ Ani le lu mbi ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani, nghaduu onyi mbi ema kpaa byi ani ita gbɛɛ, &lt;Li mi ole ngwi abu le lu baa?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Ikyegbɛɛ Ani nya ema ungwɔ ntonɛ nɛ, ema yɛɛ elela. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Nghaduu Ani le nya ema otsitsi: Li mi abɔ oyaaya mgbi ema ngwi Ani le lu dzɛ ema ta aani. Sede Ani ka lu dzɛ ema ta bayɔ, Ongye okwɛwɛwo na ka ba mbi ema ba; Kpaa kini Ani lu, Ani ka dɔnsɔ mbi ema. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Non wa ba yɔ, o ka fwo ɛsɛ ikwɔ mi ikye alobube yi osaan: <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>mi ayɛ mgbi obube yɔ, li ikyegbɛɛ a nu ani oyɛyɛ ba; <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>mi ayɛ mgbi osaan yɔ, li mi ikyegbɛɛ Ani le lu mbi Otsani, mi imbe ngwi ema ka di ani alonɔ-alonɔ wuba; <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>mi ayɛ mgbi ikwɔ ogbɔɔgbɔ yɔ, li ikyegbɛɛ ongwuutɔ mgbi ɛsɛ nɛ, a tsekise gbɔn ikwɔ.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>&lt;&lt;Ani ka dzɛ yi odzɛ kpakpa ogbɔ yi ema, nghaduu i mbwo nyɛsɛ ngwi ema ka difwi ngyɛ onɛnɛni. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Kpaa onɔ ngwi ongwu, Onodzi mgbi otsitsi, wa ba yɔ, o ka ngyo ema kaka ali otsitsi duu. O ka gbɔdzɛ mgbi ikyibɔn ba; o ka gbɔdzɛ ngwi o fwo ma kyoon ta, o dika nya ema ungwɔ nka kyɛ iyayi mani. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>O ka kye okwɔkwɔ ba mbi ani ikyekyɛ o ka kye odzɛ ngwi Ani gbɔ yilen nya ema. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Alungwɔ nli mgbi Otsani li mgbi ani. Li ikyengha ngwi ani gbɛɛ Onodzi ka todulu mi ungwɔ nli ngwi ani kye nu di nu ema yon aali.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>&lt;&lt;Mi ongwonɔ gwee ema ka wa di ani wuba, dika tunto bata ema dika wa di ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okakewo mgbi engwafɔ iYesu ka <optbreak/> yɛɛ atsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Engwafɔ mgbi iYesu angbeka gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O kye inɛ byi sinɛ ngwi o gbɛɛ, &lt;Mi ongwonɔ gwee ema ka di ani wuba, dika tunto bata ema dika wa di ani,&gt; &lt;Ikyekyɛ ani le lu mbi Otsani&gt;? &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>A kiyayi obyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwonɔ gwee nɛ ma, &lt;tso sinɛ&gt;? Eyi difwi odzɛ ngwi o le gbɔ nɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Ngwi iYesu di gbɛɛ i mina ma obyi ongwu ita mi odzɛ nɛ nɛ, o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema le byi ewema ita mi odzɛ ngwi Ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Mi ongwonɔ gwee ema ka wa di ani wuba, dika tunto bata ema dika wa di ani nɛɛ&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ani nya ema otsitsi, ema ka wa tsukwu di kyelela nghaduu ɛsɛ ka dzɛ yi atsa kwuba. Ema ka wa dzɛ mi okakewo, kpaa okakewo mgbi ema ka wa yɛɛ atsa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Ongyaa nle gblimba li dzɛ yi owulu-wulu kpakpa ikyekyɛ onɔ imba mgban gyɔ; kpaa mi onɔ ngwi o mbongwɛ yɔ, o li gblimɔ yi owulu-wulu nani ikyesinɛ atsa mgban li ogbɛɛ ongwu mbimba mi ɛsɛ nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Li ngha ndzɛ yi ema aani: Onɛnɛ li onɔ okakewo mgbi ema, kpaa Ani dika yɛ di ema ta ema ka dzɛ yi atsa, ma inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka gbɛlu ema atsa na ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Mi egbe na ema ka byi ani ita ungwɔ onyi kpaa wuba. N nya ema otsitsi, Otsani ka kye alungwɔ ngwi ema bɔ mi iyi mgbi ani duu nu ema. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Nghataa ba onɛnɛ kpaa ema bɔ unkonyi mi iyi mgbi ani waba. Bɔ na ta ema ka gbɛ, man ema ka dzɛ yi atsa kpakpa.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu ani teyi le gbɔdzɛ yi ema mi itaodzɛ, onɔ kyɛma ngwi ani ka wa gbɔ itɔ ondudzɛ nɛ yi ema wuba, kpaa n ka wa nya ema odzɛ mgbi Otsani mi ododa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Mi egbe na ema ka bɔ mi iyi mgbi ani. Ani le gbɛɛ n ka bɔ Otsani mi ikye ema ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Ei, Otsani abuon di ema kpan itukwu ikyesinɛ Ani kpa ema itukwu ema di noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ Ani kyɛ mbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Ani kyɛ mbi Otsani di wa kaka ɛsɛ nɛni; onɛnɛ ani le dzata ɛsɛ nɛ diyɛ lu mbi Otsani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Ta engwafɔ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ abu le gbɔdzɛ yi eyi gbosa di li mi itaodzɛ wuba. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Onɛnɛ eyi di gbɛɛ abu yengyɛ alungwɔ duu di mina gbɛɛ ni inggisɛ onyi kpaa no ka byi abu ita angbeka wuba. Ungwɔnɛ nu eyi noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ abu kyɛ mbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema noyɛyɛ onɛnɛɛ? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Nghaduu onɔ kyɛma, di li onɔ ma joani, onɔ ngwi a ka ganya ema, ali inggisɛ ka lu udɛ mgban. Ema ka dzata ani yuen. Kpaa Ani dzɛ yuen ba, lubana Otsani dzɛ yi ani.<verse eid="JHN 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>&lt;&lt;Ani teyi nya ema ungwɔ ntonɛ, ikyegbɛɛ ni ema tu iyu ikpewo ani. Mi ɛsɛ nɛ ema ka dzɛ yi okakewo. Nghaduu bwalu itukwu na! Ani ngha ɛsɛ wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu bibɔ mi ikye ewon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Dafi iYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ ngyɛ nɛ, o kyile inɛ esho si bibɔ gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 17:1"/>
  <para style="pi" vid="JHN 17:1">&lt;&lt;Otsani, onɔ ma gyɔ wa. Kye Okwɔkwɔ nu ongwabu, adzi ni Ongwabu kpaa kye okwɔkwɔ nu abu. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Bana abu teyi kye mfye nun mi ikye mgbi ali inggisɛ duu gbɛɛ no kye oshishe gyegwu nu ama abu kye nun duu. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Ma li oshishe gyegwu aani: li onu ma ye abu, Imgbasho otsitsi yuon, bɛyi iYesu iKrestu, ongwu abu dɔn esɔ nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ani kye okwɔkwɔ nu abu mi ɛsɛ mi ongyɛlu idɔ ngwi abu kye nu ani gbɛɛ ni ani kyɔ mani. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Ikyenghanɛ, Otsani, nu ani okwɔkwɔ mi inai abu okwɔkwɔ ngwi ani teyi dzɛyan yi abu duuse ɛsɛ wa wita nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu bibɔ mi ikye engwafɔɔn</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>&lt;&lt;Ani kye abu tso mbi ama abu kye nu ani mi ɛsɛ nɛni. A teyi li mgbi abu; abu kye ma nu ani a di ngyo elodzɛ mgbi abu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Onɛnɛ a ye gbɛɛ ungwɔ ngwi Ani dzɛyan duu kyɛ mbi abu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Lubana ani kye elodzɛ ngwi abu kye nu ani ma nu ma a di kyi gbɛlu. A ye saan gbɛɛ ani kyɛ mbi abu, a di noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ abu dɔ ani esɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>Ani bibɔ mi ikye ma. Ani le bibɔ mi ikye mgbi ɛsɛ ba, kpaa li mi ikye mgbi ama ngwu abu teyi gbe ma nu ani, ikyesinɛ a li mgbi abu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Alungwɔ ani dzɛyan duu li mgbi abu, alungwɔ abu di dzɛyan duu li mgbi ani. Ani di tu okwɔkwɔ ikpewo ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Ani ka dzɛ ɛsɛ nɛ wuba, kpaa ama ka to ɛsɛ nɛni, ani kyɛma le lu mbi abu. Otsani Osaan, ngyo ma mi mfye mgbi iyi mgbi abu, iyi ngwi abu kye nu ani ikye nu ma yɛɛ onyi dafi eyi kpaa li onyi nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Mi onɔ ngwi ani ka dzɛ yi ama ma, ani ngyo ma di kye ma dzɛ saan mi iyi ngwi abu kye nu ani. Onyi kpaa byulu ba sede li onyi ongwu dzɛ mi ikye odzili-dzili, ikyegbɛɛ ni elodzɛ mgbi Afɛ mbwumbwo nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ani kyɛma le ba mbi abu onɛnɛni, nghaduu ani gbɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ ngwi ani ka dzɛ ɛsɛ nɛni, ikyegbɛɛ nu ma tu atsa kpakpa dafi ani kpaa tu nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Ani teyi kye elodzɛ mgbi abu nu ma wa, kpaa ɛsɛ di ma kyili, ikyekyɛ a li mgbi ɛsɛ nɛ wuba dafi ani kpaa li mgbi ɛsɛ nɛ ba nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ibɔ mgbi ani li ikyegbɛɛ ni abu kye gbelu ma mi ɛsɛ nɛ ba, kpaa li ikyegbɛɛ ni abu ngyo ma mi abɔ emi obube. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>A li mgbi ɛsɛ nɛ ba, dafi ani kpaa li mgbi ɛsɛ nɛ ba nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Kye ma kyi salu mi otsitsi mgbi abu; elodzɛ mgbi abu li otsitsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Dafi abu dɔ ani esɔ ba ɛsɛ nɛ nɛ, ani kpaa dɔ ma esɔ mi ɛsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Mi ikye mgbi ama ani kye ewani kyi salu, adzi ni a kyi salu ma saan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu bibɔ ikye ama onoyɛyɛ duu</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>&lt;&lt;Ibɔ mgbi ani li ikye ma yuoma ba. Ani bibɔ ikye ama nka wa noyɛyɛ mbi ani mi esɔ mgbi ama ogbɔɔgbɔ kpaa, <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>gbɛɛ ama duu nu ma wa yɛɛ onyi, Otsani, dafi abu dzɛ mbi ani ngwi ani kpaa dzɛ mbi abu nɛni. Ni ama kpaa dzɛ mbi eyi ikye ni ɛsɛ noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ abu dɔ ani esɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Ani kye okwɔkwɔ ngwi abu kye nu ani ma nu ma wa, ikyegbɛɛ nu ma li onyi, dafi eyi kpaa li onyi nɛni: <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Ani wo mboma abu di wo mbi ani. Ni a gbe ma duu kwakye yɛɛ ondonyi onu ɛsɛ ye gbɛɛ abu dɔ ani esɔ, a di kpa abu itukwu yɛyɛ dafi ani kpa abu itukwu nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>&lt;&lt;Otsani, ani mina gbɛɛ ama ngwu abu kye nu ani ma nu ma dzɛ yi ani mi imbe ngwi ani dzɛ mani, odi di okwɔkwɔ mgbi ani, okwɔkwɔ ngwi abu kye nu ani ikyesinɛ ani kpa abu itukwu duuse ni abu ta ɛsɛ nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>&lt;&lt;Otsani Osaan, dafi ɛsɛ ye abu ba nɛ kpaa, ani ye abu, ma engwafɔ ntonɛ ye dafi abu dɔ ani esɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Ani teyi kye abu tso ma, dika kiyayi ole kye abu tso ikyegbɛɛ okpitukwu mgbi abu mbi ani no dzɛ mboma ani abuen kpaa dika dzɛ mboma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">A bwa iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu bibɔ ngyɛ nɛ, ongwu yi engwafɔɔn fa ufɛ mgbi iKidrɔn. Mi oyombo na okwɔ ekwɔ dzɛ, a si kaka efu. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>IJuda, nkyon gya na, ye imbe nani, ikyesinɛ iYesu li teyi kwakye mi imbe na alonɔ yi engwafɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>IJuda si ba okwɔ ekwɔ nani, o gbe obyi oblakwutsɛ mgbi emi iRoma bɛyi ama ongyo ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho angbeka nkyɛ mbi engyukwo ama ofifɛ bɛyi emi iFarasi teyi. A gbe ola byi yi okyiika.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Ngwi iYesu teyi ye alungwɔ nka wa kyɔn nɛ, o tasɛ ka byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ ngwi ema le pitan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>A nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IYesu ongwi iNadzareti.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani ma aani.&gt;&gt; (iJuda ongwu nkyon gya na, kwudzɛ mmana yi ama.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani ma aani,&gt;&gt; nɛta a yɛyikpa zudɔwokɛ esɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>O diyɛ byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ ngwi ema le pitan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">A di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IYesu ongwi iNadzareti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N teyi nya ema gbɛɛ li ani ma aani. Kini ema le pita ani yɔ, ni inggisɛ ntonɛ lu na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Ungwɔnɛ kyɔ ikyegbɛɛ elodzɛ ngwi o teyi gbɔ ma no mbwumbwo: &lt;&lt;Ani nu onyi kpaa byulu mi ama ngwu abu gbe nu ani ntonɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Nɛ iSaimɔn iPyita, ongwu ndzɛ yi okwusunkli na, kye ngwalu kye kwɔdzɛ adɔ abugye mgbi ongbidɔ mgbi okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ. (Ongbidɔ na iyin di iMalku.)<verse eid="JHN 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Nghaduu iYesu wo iPyita ola gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Yile okwusunkli mgbi abu wokɛ ifwɛ. Nin ka wa ibwɛ ngwi Otsani kye nu ani nɛ baa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A kye iYesu kɛ mbi Anna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Obyi oblakwutsɛ yi ongyukwo mgbi ama bɛyi ama ongyo ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho bwalu iYesu. A bwan adi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>si kyon kɛ mbi Anna ababɔ, ongwu li otsowa iKayafa, nli okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ mi onova na mani. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>IKayafa li ongwu teyi wɛ emi iJuda ɛwɛ gbɛɛ i tatase gbɛɛ ni inggisɛ onyi kwulu mi ikye ibyi inggisɛ mani.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IPyita tangwɛ iYesu akpe ongwi ababɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>ISaimɔn iPyita yi ongwafɔ oka kyɛdɔ iYesu. Ikyekyɛ ongwafɔ nɛ okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ na yon, nghanɛ o kaka yi iYesu mi idzidzɛ udɛ mgbi okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ nani, <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>kpaa iPyita yɔ kwudzɛ onufoka mi esɛ. Ta ongwafɔ oka, ngwu okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ yon na, yɛ wa gbɔdzɛ yi ongwongyaa ndzɛ ondu idɔ mi onufoka, man o kye iPyita kaka idzidzɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Ongwongyaa mi onufɛ na byi iPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kpaa li onyi mi engwafɔ mgban lɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li Ani ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Onɔ ma ofu le yi, nɛ engbidɔ bɛyi ama ongyoongyo kwudzɛ kpakɛkɛ wo ola ngwi a kye wo le wɛ mani. IPyita kpaa kwudzɛ le wola yi ama.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ byi iYesu ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Nghanɛ, okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ na byi iYesu ita mi odzɛ mgbi engwafɔɔn bɛyi otsootso mgban.<verse eid="JHN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani gbɔdzɛ nya ɛsɛ mi ododa, n li tso alonɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda hona mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, imbe ngwi emi iJuda duu li kwakye nani. N gbɔdzɛ onyi mi odaada ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Kyɔsinɛse ngwi abu le byi ani ita? Byi ama nfwo ani mani. Otsitsi a ye ungwɔ ngwi ani gbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Mi onɔ ngwi iYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ ma, onyi mbi ama ongyoongyo ndzɛ kwɛkwɛ yan ma tan afɛ mi inɛ. O byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ngha ngwi a li nu okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ uka daa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini ani gbɔ ungwɔ nli ayin bayɔ, tso ani obwɛndɛ mi ungwɔ nli obube mani. Kpaa kini ani gbɔ otsitsi ma, kyɔnɛ ngwi abu ta ani afɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Nɛta Anna si kyon dɛsɔ, yi adi mi abɔ, lu mbi iKayafa, okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ nani.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IPyita tangwɛ iYesu akpe ongwu fan <optbreak/> yi ongwu ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Dafi iSaimɔn iPyita ka kwudzɛ le wola nɛ, a di byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li onyi mi engwafɔɔn wɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">O tangwɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Nghaduu onyi mbi ama ongyoongyo mgbi okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ na, ongwu nli odo yi ongyulɔ ngwu iPyita teyi dzan adɔ na, fwa ikwangha yi iPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani di abu yi iYesu mi okwɔ baa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>IPyita di tangwɛ, labɔlabɔ nɛta ogbigbi wita oteela.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IPlatu fwo iYesu ikwɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Ta emi iJuda kyelu iYesu mbi iKayafa lu opiikwɔ mgbi iGɔna inggisɛ iRoma. Onɔ na li egbegbe ototu, mi ikye ofwa idza owa ndɛlu ma oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda nɛ, emi iJuda fwa okaka udɛ iGɔna. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>IPlatu tasɛ kɛ mboma ka byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ali itɔdzɛ ngwi ema kye le ba mi ikpewo ongyulɔ nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>A nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ ki kyungwɔ obube bayɔ, eyi ki kyon ba mbi abu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>IPlatu gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nghanɛ kyon abuema ka gbɔn ikwɔ mi ola mgbi ema na.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Emi iJuda fwa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ola nu eyi ofɛ ongwɔ inggisɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Ungwɔnɛ kyɔ ikyegbɛɛ odzɛ ngwi iYesu teyi gbɔ mi itɔ ikwu ngwi ongwu ka wa kwu ma no mbwumbwo.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>IPlatu si yɛ kaka ifoozu, kwu iYesu ela ba di byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li utɔ mgbi emi iJudaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>IYesu byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ɛwɛ otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi abu naadi inggisɛ angbeka nya abu odzɛ mi ikye ani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>IPlatu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li emi iJudaa? Li emidabu yi engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi abu kye abu ba mbi ani aani. Li alungwɔ abu kyɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Esutɔ mgbi ani li ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ ba. Ki li ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ yɔ, engbidɔ mgbɛn kika gblika ikye otukwu ofɛ onu emi iJuda bwa ani. Nghaduu esutɔ mgbi ani dzɛ mbeka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>IPlatu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngyɛse, abu li utɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O gbɔ ayin ogbɛɛ di ani li utɔ. Mi otsitsi yɔ, li itɔdzɛ nɛ ngwi a mba ani, di li itɔdzɛ nɛ ngwi ani ba ɛsɛ nɛni, ikye okyɔ obwɛndɛ mi otsitsi nani. Ali inggisɛ ndzɛ mi agya mgbi otsitsi yɔ li fwo ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>IPlatu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ li otsitsi?&gt;&gt; Mi odzɛ nɛ o di tasɛ kɛ mbi emi iJuda ka gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N tun yi obube ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Ema dzɛ yi aletɔ mgbi ema onu ani dulu inggisɛ onyi mi obawi mi onɔ oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda nu ema. Ema mina gbɛɛ ni ani dulu utɔ mgbi emi iJudaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Nghaduu a wulu ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei, no ka li ongwu ba! Kye iBaraba nu eyi!&gt;&gt; Onɔ na iBaraba wo abɔ mi ablodzɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">A ngwɔ iYesu ikwɔ owa gbokwon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Ta iPlatu woola nu ma gbo iYesu onitse. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Ama oblakwutsɛ ndi akata ato kye tukwun ikye. A kye awulu omuma shinishini kye won <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>diyɛ kɛ mbon dudɔ-dudɔ, gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi ta abu angba, utɔ mgbi emi iJuda!&gt;&gt; A dile tukwun afɛ mi inɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>IPlatu di tasɛ ba esɛ wa gbɔ yi emi iJuda gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii, ani kyon le ba esɛ mbi ema ni ema ye gbɛɛ ani tun yi obube mi elikwɔ ngwi ema kwun nɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Ngwi iYesu tasɛ ba esɛ yi akata ato mi ikye bɛyi awulu omuma shinishini mi ewo nɛ, iPlatu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyulɔ ma dzɛ na!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Plɛ ngwi engyukwo ama ofifɛ bɛyi ama ongyoongyo mgbi ama din nɛ, a wulu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbokwon mi ekwatsi! Gbokwon mi ekwatsi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Nghaduu iPlatu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema kyon ka gbokwo mi ekwatsi abuema na. Mbi ani yɔ, ani tu itɔdzɛ mi elikwɔ mgban ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Emi iJuda biibɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi dzɛ yi ola, ma mi ola mgbi eyi mayɔ, o ka kwulu kyɛmɛ, ikyena o kye ewon gbɛɛ ongwu li Ongwɛ Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Ngwi iPlatu fwo ungwɔnɛ nɛ, i nghao kwulun ewo, <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>ta o diyɛ kaka ifyudɛ. O byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kyɛ mi ole?&gt;&gt; Nghaduu iYesu kwondu won ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>IPlatu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu fwa ogbɔdzɛ yi anii? Abu difwi gbɛɛ ani dzɛ yi mfye odzata abu hona gbokwo abu mi ekwatsi baa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kika dzɛ yi mfye mi ikye ani ba, ni a ki kye nu abu kyɛ esho bayɔ. Nghaduukpaa ongwu nkye ani nu mi abɔ mgbi ema na, nghao kyɔ obube duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Wita mi onɔ na lu iyayi, iPlatu fya odzata iYesu, kpaa emi iJuda kiyayi owulu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini abu dzata ongyulɔ nɛ lu yɔ, abu li oka iSidza wuba. Ali inggisɛ nkye ewon gbɛɛ ongwu li utɔ duu kye iga le fyɛsɛ yi iSidza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Ngwi iPlatu fwo odzɛ nɛ nɛ, o ka kye iYesu luba esɛ man sɔkɛ itse ogbiikwɔ mi imbe ngwi a li kwun di Ikwutsɛ (ngwi a li kwun mi ondudzɛ Aramai gbɛɛ iGabata nani). <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Li mi egbe owewo mgbi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi iJuda, di li mi onɔ idzizudɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Nɛ iPlatu nya emi iJuda gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Utɔ mgbi ema dzana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Nghaduu a wulu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyon lu mmɛnɛni! Kyon lu mmɛnɛni! Gbokwon ngwɔn!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ta iPlatu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nin gbokwo utɔ mgbi ema mi ekwatsii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Engyukwo ama ofifɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi dzɛ yi utɔ oka ba li iSidza yuon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Mi ongyɛɛngyɛ duu iPlatu kyon nu ma gbɛɛ nu ma ka gbokwon mi ekwatsi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">A gbokwo iYesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Man ama oblakwutsɛ kye iYesu lu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Ngwi o kye ekwatsi mgban nɛ, o lu imbe idingbo (ngwi a li kwun mi ondudzɛ Aramai di iGogota nani). <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Mi imbe nɛ a gbokwon yi inggisɛ efa, oka mi abugye yi oka mi abubɛ, iYesu wo idzidzɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="A gbokwo iYesu" file="DN00493b.tif" size="col" loc="19;18" copy="Dunhan" ref="19:18">Jesus is crucified</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>IPlatu nu ma lɔ ungwɔ kye bɛkɛ mi ekwatsi. I gbɔgbɛɛ: IYESU ONGWI INADZARETI, UTƆ MGBI EMI IJUDA. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Emi iJuda kwuba gbɔ ambɛ nɛni, bana imbe ngwi a gbokwo iYesu ma dzɛ kwɛkwɛ yi igeli okwukwo, ambɛ na a lɔn mi ondu Aramai, iLatin yi iGriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi emi iJuda fwa yi iPlatu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka lɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Utɔ mgbi emi iJuda ba,&gt; kpaa gbɛɛ ongyulɔ nɛ li kye ewon gbɛɛ ongwu li utɔ mgbi emi iJuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>IPlatu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔ ngwi ani lɔ yɔ, ani lɔ setawaali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Onɔ ngwi ama oblakwutsɛ gbokwo iYesu mi ekwatsi ngyɛ nɛ, a kyi gbelu angwuto mgban, kyi ghalu imbe enɛ, onyi mi ikye mgbi ali inggisɛ mgbi ama, i sisi awulu mgban. Angwuto nɛ dzɛ yi okwokyiikwokyi ba, li ungwonyi kyɛ esho lu esɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Ama oblakwutsɛ ntona gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi ka fawa angwuto nɛ ba, eyi ka gbo efa mi ele ni eyi ye inggisɛ nka li mgban.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Ungwɔnɛ kyɔ ikye ombwumbwo ungwɔ ntsekise dzɛ mi Afɛ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 19:24"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;A kye ghalu angwuto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">mgbi ani nu ewoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">di gbo efa mi abu mgbi ani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 19:24"/>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Li ungwɔ ngwi ama oblakwutsɛ kyɔ aani.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Onɔ iYesu kwudzɛ kwɛkwɛ yi ekwatsi mgbi iYesu yi oshanɔn, yi iMeri owa iKlopa, bɛyi iMeri iMagidalin. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Dafi iYesu di onɔn mi imbe na, yi ongwafɔɔn ngwu kpan itukwu kwudzɛ yan nɛ, iYesu nya onɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa ongwabu dzana,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>o diyɛ gbɔ yi ongwafɔɔn na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onabu dzana.&gt;&gt; Wita mi onɔ na nghataa lu iyayi, ongwafɔɔn na kye iMeri lu udɛ mgban.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikwu iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Onɔ gwee nɛ, iYesu ye dafi alungwɔ duu ngyɛ, ma ikyegbɛɛ ni ungwɔ ndzɛ mi Afɛ mbwumbwo yɔ, O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;ekweni kwin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Mi imbe na atankpɛ eneekwɔ ofyunfyummya ba dzɛ ele, nghanɛ a kye isoso tswokɛ ele, kye fakɛ anggekwɔ ihiso, kyilen bɛ iYesu kɛ ikpondu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Ngwi iYesu wa duu nɛ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I ngyɛ wa.&gt;&gt; Ta, o kye onbukwɔ ngwuta si yulu.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Ungwɔnɛ kyɔ mi obwi, tegblifan li egbe otonyewo mgbi emi iJuda. Ikyegbɛɛ emi iJuda mina gbɛɛ ni ikwɔ ntona fato ekwatsi mi egbe otonyewo ba nɛ, a ka bɔ iPlatu ofɛ gbɛɛ nu ma gbikye ma afɔ di tashulu ikwɔ ntonani. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Ama oblakwutsɛ ba wa gbikye afɔ efa mgbi inggisɛ ongwu ababɔ ngwu a kyon gbokwo mi ekwatsi yi iYesu dika gbikye mgbi oka nani. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Nghaduu ngwi a ba mbi iYesu ma, a difwi dafi o teyi kwulu wa nɛ, a gbikyen afɔ wuba. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Nɛta, inggisɛ oblakwutsɛ oka kye okpa kwo iYesu mi esa, ta eyi yi eni fɛ lon mi esa. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Inggisɛ ndi ma kyɔ obwɛndɛ, obwɛndɛ mgban li otsitsi. O ye gbɛɛ ongwu gbɔ otsitsi, di kyɔ obwɛndɛ ikyegbɛɛ ni ema kpaa ki noyɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Ungwɔ ntonɛ kyɔ adzi ni ondu odzɛɛdzɛ ngwi Afɛ dzɛ gbɛɛ &lt;&lt;Akpukpu mgban onyi kpaa a ka gbikyen ba,&gt;&gt; na no mbwumbwo. <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Dafi Afɛ oka di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A ka di ongwu a kwon okpa nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A ndzi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Onɔ gwee nɛ, iJose ongwi Arimatia wa bɔ iPlatu ikwɔ mgbi iYesu. IJose kpaa li ongwafɔ mgbi iYesu, o wa bɔ mi odaada ikyekyɛ o le mio emi iJuda. Dafi iPlatu nun ofɛ nɛ, o wa kyi kyelu ikwɔ mgbi iYesu lu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>O kyɛ bɛyi iNikodemu, ongyulɔ nteyi kɛ mbi iYesu mi otu nani. INikodemu ba yi ungwɔ ama ogbungbɛ kwuba ngwi a kye bwuo yi ewoma mɛ mlo dafi ngwuseta dɔn iwyo diwyeda sini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ngwi a kyi kyelu ikwɔ mgbi iYesu nɛ, ama efa kye ikwɔ na ndi wokɛ angwuto yi ungwɔ ama ogbungbɛ ntonani. A kyungwɔnɛ dafi emi iJuda li ndzi inggisɛ mi aletɔ mgbi ama mani. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Imbe ngwi a gbokwo iYesu mi ekwatsi na, li mi okwɔ, di li mi okwɔ na ngwi endzi ofufɛ dzɛ ele, ongwi a ndzi inggisɛ mi ele ye waba. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ikyegbɛɛ li egbe owewo mgbi emi iJuda mi ikye egbe otonyewo, endzi di dzɛ kwɛkwɛ nɛ, a kye iYesu ndzi mi ele.<figure style="fig" alt="A ndzi iYesu" file="cn01848B.tif" size="col" loc="19;42" copy="Cn01850B" ref="19:42">The burial of Jesus</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Endzi nla ayayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Egbe Iladi mi egbegbe ototu nɛ, iMeri iMagidalin kɛ endzi ka di dafi ikwutsɛ ngwi a kye tukwu ondendzi na a kye mulu.<figure style="fig" alt="Endzi nla ayayi" file="cn01850B.tif" size="col" loc="20;1" ref="20:1">The Empty Tomb</figure> <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Nɛ o nyɛ yi onya kɛ mbi iSaimɔn iPyita bɛyi ongwafɔ oka, ongwu nkpa iYesu itukwu nani, ka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A kyi dulu Otsɛ iYesu mi endzi, ma eyi ye imbe ngwi a kyon ka lakɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Ta iPyita yi ongwafɔ na kyato olu imbe ngwi endzi dzɛ mani. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Ama efa le lu onyonya, kpaa ongwafɔ oka na tsinya ngha iPyita teyi ka to itendzi ababɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>O klɛsɛ winɛ mi ifun kpaa li angwuto ngwi a kye ndi wo iYesu mata ladzɛ ele, nghaduu o kaka ifun ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Nɛ iSaimɔn iPyita, ngwu kyan iyikpa ma, wa to si kaka lu ifendzi. O di angwuto ikwɔ ntona lato ifun, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>bɛyi ayangwuto ngwi a kye bwa iYesu ikye nani. Angwuto na fulu ewon, i lakɛ idzidza yi ongwi a ndzin mi ele mani. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Ongyɛɛngyɛ yɔ, ongwafɔ oka ongwu nteyi kaka itendzi ababɔ na kpaa, kaka ifun ka di si noyɛyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>(Nghaduukpaa i gbosa lo ma mi odzɛ ngwi Afɛ gbɛɛ iYesu ka kyɛɛ mi ikwu na ba.)<verse eid="JHN 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu mblegba tu iMeri iMagidalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Ta engwafɔ ntona yidɔ lu udɛ mgbi ama, <verse eid="JHN 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>kpaa iMeri yɔ tila dzɛ itendzi le tsukwu. Dafi o le tsukwu nɛ, o klɛsɛ le winɛ mi ifendzi <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>man di engyesɔ nghi efa wo angwuto onzundzɛ, a sɔto imbe ngwi a teyi kye ikwɔ mgbi iYesu la mani, onyi mi ikye oka mi atafɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>A byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa, li ekyɛ ngwi abu le tsukwu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A kyi kyelu ikwɔ mgbi Otsɛ iYesu mgbi ani lu, ma ani ye imbe ngwi a kyon ka lakɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ mata, o ndinɛ kpatsɛ man o di iYesu kwudzɛ imbe nani, nghaduu o difwi gbɛɛ li iYesu ba.<verse eid="JHN 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa, li ekyɛ ngwi abu le tsukwu? Li emɛ ngwu abu le ndinan?&gt;&gt; Ongyaa na tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ o li otsungwɔ okwɔ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, kini abu kyon lu yɔ, nya ani imbe ngwi abu kyon lakɛ mani nin nka kyi kye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IMeri!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">O kyata inɛ byun man kwu ela okwukwo mi ondu Aramai gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IRaboni!&gt;&gt; (Ngwi itan gbɛɛ otsetse).<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka tsɛkwulin ba, ikyesinɛ N yidɔ lu mbi Otsɛn waba. Nghaduukpaa lu ka nya emi ongwunani gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani le yidɔ lu mbi Otsani bɛyi Otsema, mbi Imgbasho mgbi Ani yi Imgbasho mgbi ema.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>IMeri iMagidalin kye esɔ nɛ lu mbi engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani di Otsɛ iYesu!&gt;&gt; O di nya ma gbɛɛ o nya ongwu ungwɔ ntonɛni.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu mblegba tu engwafɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Mi onɔdɛ mi egbe iLadi na, ngwi engwafɔɔn kwakye yi eka nɛ, a kye ofɛ tukwu bana a le mio emi iJuda, iYesu ba wa kwudzɛkɛ idzidzɛ mgbi ama si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyu no dzɛ yi ema!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Ngwi o gbɔ ungwɔnɛ nyɛ nɛ, o gbe abɔ tso ma bɛyi esa. Engwafɔɔn tsatsa kwuba mi onɔ ngwi a di Otsɛ iYesu mani.<verse eid="JHN 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>IYesu di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyu non dzɛ yi ema! Dafi Otsani dɔ ani esɔ nɛ, ani kpaa le dɔ ema ngha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Yi odzɛ na ta, o tufu ma wo si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbɛ Onodzi Osaan na. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Kini ema dzata inggisɛ yi ali ibwubwe mgban yɔ, a dzanta yan, kini ema dzatan bayɔ, a dzanta ba sewaali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu mblegba tu iTɔmɔsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Nghaduu iTɔmɔsu (ongwu a li kwun di ongwefa nani), onyi mbi emi iwyodefa ntona dzɛ yi ama mi onɔ ngwi iYesu ba ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Nghanɛ engwafɔ angbeka ntona nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi di Otsɛ iYesu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Kpaa o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li kyɛmɛ ngwi ani ka di emi ambɛ mgbi ikusa mi abɔ mgban di kye ongwufabɔ kɛ imbe a gbokwon ikusa ntona, di kye abɔ mgbi ani kaan esa bayɔ, n ka noyɛyɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Ngwi i wa nyɛ egbe egyata nɛ, engwafɔ mgban di woto yi eka, iTɔmɔsu kpaa wodzɛ yi ama. Dafi onufozu tukwu nɛ kpaa, iYesu wa kwudzɛkɛ idzidzɛ ma di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyu no dzɛ yi ema!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Ta o nya iTɔmɔsu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye ongwufabɔ mgbi abu bɛkɛ mmɛnɛni, di atabɔ mgbi ani. Na abɔ mgbi abu ba esa mgbi ani, ka tangwɛ wuba kpaa noyɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>ITɔmɔsu si kwun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ mgbi ani yi Imgbasho mgbi ani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ikyegbɛɛ abu di ani nɛ, abu nu ani oyɛyɛ, mse no dzɛ yi inggisɛ ama ndi ani ba kpaa noyɛyɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>IYesu kyɔ ambɛ ungwɔ angbeka okwulewo gwuba mi inai engwafɔɔn, ngwi a lɔ ma wo afɛ nɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Kpaa ntonɛ a lɔ ma ikyegbɛɛ ni ema noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ iYesu li iMedzaya, Ongwɛ Imgbasho, di li ikyegbɛɛ ni ema noyɛyɛ mi iyi mgban ta ema ka tu oshishe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu tsetu engwafɔ egyafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, iYesu di tsetu emi ongwafɔɔn, mi ekyoo okwukwo mgbi iTiberia. Li itɔ ofɛ ngwi i kyɔ joani: <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>iSaimɔn iPyita, iTɔmɔsu (ngwi a li kwun di ongwefa nani) iNataniɛ ongwi iKana mi ɛsɛ iGalalia, emi ongwɛ iDzebedi, bɛyi engwafɔ mgbi iYesu angbeka efa kpaa to mbonyi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>ISaimɔn iPyita nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani le lu mtsɛ ota-ta,&gt;&gt; a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi kpaa ka kɛ yi abu.&gt;&gt; Ta a si tasɛ ka kaka uwaa, kpaa mi otu na duu a kwu unkonyi ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Mi egbegbe ototu nɛ iYesu wa kwudzɛkɛ mi agobo, kpaa emi engwafɔɔn yagba difwi gbɛɛ li iYesu ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>O kwu ma ela kɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Emi okani, ema kwu nka wa lo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">A nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngwi Ibriji mgbi ema mi abugye mgbi uwaa ta ema ka kwu ungwɔ.&gt;&gt; Ngwi a kyɔ ngha nɛta, a yagba okwo ukɛ kaka uwaa ba, ikye mmbweni kwuba ngwi a kwu mani.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Ta ongwafɔ nkpa iYesu itukwu na nya iPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li Otsɛ iYesu!&gt;&gt; Ngwi iSaimɔn iPyita fwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li Otsɛ nɛ,&gt;&gt; o kye angwuto mgban ongwi esɛ tukwu (lubana o teyi kye kwulu mi ewo) man ngwa gyɛkɛ eni. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Engwafɔ angbeka ntona kyɛdɔ mi uwaa, a kwo ukɛ yi mmbwɛ ngwi mbweele ma luba agobo, ikyesinɛ i tunto yi agobo ba, i mɛ dafi akwubɔ ideli onyi hini. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Ngwi a tɔ lu agobo nɛ, a di ibredi ladzɛ, angola le gbɛ mmbweni di dɔdzɛ ele.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dulu mmbwɛ ngwi ema kwa kwu nɛ ba na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>ISaimɔn iPyita tɔdɔkɛ uwaa di kye kwolu ukɛ dɔkɛ esɛ. Mmbweni okwukwo mbweele, duu li ideli onyi yi ngwusefa dɔn iwyo diwyeta, ma dafi mmbwɛ ntona le kwuba nɛ kpaa ukɛ fawa ba. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba wa tiikyɛ na.&gt;&gt; Onyi mi ifu ma kpaa shitukwu byun ita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li emɛ ba&gt;&gt; A ye dafi li Otsɛ iYesu mani. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>IYesu wa kyelu ibredi ma kye nu ma, di kyɔ ngha yɛyɛ yi mmbweni ma kpaa <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Nɛnɛ li akpe ongwu ta ngwi iYesu mblegba tu emi ongwafɔɔn mi onɔ ngwi o kyɛ mi ikwu aani.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yile iPyita dzɛ ofɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Onɔ ngwi a gye ungwogye ngyɛ nɛ, iYesu byi iSaimɔn iPyita ita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;iSaimɔn ongwɛ iJɔn, otsitsi-otsitsi ani kpa abu itukwu ngha ungwɔ ntonɛɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, Otsɛ, abu ye dafi abu kpa ani itukwu mani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Byi mmala mgbi ani enbwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>IYesu di byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;ISaimɔn ongwɛ iJɔn, ani kpa abu itukwu otsitsii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">O nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, Otsɛ iYesu, abu ye dafi abu kpa ani itukwu mani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbɛwɛbyi mmala mgbi ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Akpe ongwu ta o byin gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;iSaimɔn ongwɛ iJɔn, ani kpa abu itukwuu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">IPyita wulu itukwu ikyesinɛ iYesu byun akpe ongwu ta gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani kpa abu itukwuu?&gt;&gt; O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, abu ye alungwɔ duu; abu ye gbɛɛ abu kpa ani itukwu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Byi mmala mgbi ani enbwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>N nya abu otsitsi, onɔ ngwi abu li mmafa ma, o li gbe angwuto wo ewo di kɛ imbe ngwi abu mina duu, kpaa onɔ ngwi abu yɛɛ ishongye abu ka na abɔ mgbi abu efa, inggisɛ oka ka gbe angwuto wo abu di kye abu kɛ imbe nmina abu okɛɛkɛ ba mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>IYesu gbɔ ungwɔnɛ ikye otso itɔ ikwu mgbi iPyita ngwi o ka wa kwu kye okwɔkwɔ nu Imgbasho mani. Ta o nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɛdɔ ani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>IPyita kyata inɛ man di ongwafɔ nkpa iYesu itukwu na kyɛ ma iyikpa. (Li ongwu nsɔ kye ewo ge iYesu mi onɔ ngwi a le gye ungwogye ongwi olɛlɛ di li ongwu teyi byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, li emɛ ka kye abu gya?&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Onɔ ngwi iPyita din nɛ, o byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, li ekyɛ ngwi inggisɛ nɛ ka kyɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;kini ani mina gbɛɛ no dzɛ oshishe nghataa ni ani wa yɛ ba ma, li ekyɛ mgbi ema mi ele? Abu yɔ kyɛdɔ ani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Mi ikye odzɛ nɛ, ayayi odzɛ gbɔfwɛ mbi emi ongwunɔn gbɛɛ ongwafɔ nɛ ka kwulu ba. Nghaduu iYesu gbɛɛ o ka kwulu ba ba, o gbɔɔgbɔ ta gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini ani mina gbɛɛ non dzɛ oshishe nghataa ni ani wa yɛ ma, li ekyɛ mgbi ema mi ele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Nɛnɛ li ongwafɔ nkyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ungwɔ ntonɛ duu di lɔ ma tokɛ esɛ. Eyi ye dafi obwɛndɛ mgban li otsitsi mani.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>IYesu kyungwɔ angbeka kpaa kwuba. Ni a ki lɔ alungwɔ duu tokɛ esɛ yɔ, n tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ ɛsɛ duu kpaa imbe kika dzɛ ogbe afɛ ntona tokɛ ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
